/* Original bilingual draft meanings. Scripture is in a separate immutable file. Human review pending. */
window.GLP_LINE_MEANINGS=[{"id":"mool.line01","english":"One all-pervading Reality: true Name, creative Being, without fear or enmity, timeless, beyond birth, self-existent; known through the Guru’s grace.","punjabi":"ਇੱਕ ਸਰਬ-ਵਿਆਪਕ ਹਸਤੀ: ਜਿਸ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਦਾ ਸੱਚ ਹੈ, ਜੋ ਰਚਨਹਾਰ ਹੈ, ਡਰ ਤੇ ਵੈਰ ਤੋਂ ਰਹਿਤ, ਸਮੇਂ ਤੇ ਜਨਮ ਤੋਂ ਪਰੇ ਅਤੇ ਆਪਣੇ ਆਪ ਤੋਂ ਹੈ; ਗੁਰੂ ਦੀ ਕਿਰਪਾ ਨਾਲ ਉਸ ਦੀ ਸੂਝ ਮਿਲਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"mool","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"title.line01","english":"Jap — the composition’s heading, inviting remembrance and contemplation.","punjabi":"ਜਪੁ — ਇਸ ਬਾਣੀ ਦਾ ਸਿਰਲੇਖ; ਸਿਮਰਨ ਅਤੇ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਵੱਲ ਸੱਦਾ।","unitId":"title","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"opening.line01","english":"True at the beginning; true through the ages.","punjabi":"ਆਰੰਭ ਤੋਂ ਸੱਚ; ਯੁੱਗਾਂ ਦੇ ਮੁੱਢ ਤੋਂ ਸੱਚ।","unitId":"opening","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"opening.line02","english":"True now too, Nanak says, and true in the time to come.","punjabi":"ਹੁਣ ਵੀ ਸੱਚ ਹੈ; ਨਾਨਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ, ਅੱਗੇ ਵੀ ਸੱਚ ਰਹੇਗਾ।","unitId":"opening","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri01.line01","english":"Outward cleansing does not bring inner purity, even if repeated countless times. Study notes discuss another reading of ਸੋਚੈ as thinking.","punjabi":"ਬਾਹਰਲੀ ਸੁੱਚ ਨਾਲ ਅੰਦਰਲੀ ਸੁੱਚ ਨਹੀਂ ਬਣਦੀ, ਭਾਵੇਂ ਇਹ ਜਤਨ ਲੱਖ ਵਾਰ ਕੀਤਾ ਜਾਵੇ। ਵਿਸਥਾਰ ਵਿੱਚ ਸੋਚੈ ਦੇ ਹੋਰ ਪਾਠ-ਅਰਥ ਦੀ ਵੀ ਚਰਚਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri01","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri01.line02","english":"Outward silence does not quiet the mind, even through sustained absorbed sitting.","punjabi":"ਬਾਹਰੋਂ ਚੁੱਪ ਰਹਿਣ ਨਾਲ ਮਨ ਦੀ ਚੁੱਪ ਨਹੀਂ ਬਣਦੀ, ਭਾਵੇਂ ਲਗਾਤਾਰ ਲਿਵ ਜੋੜ ਕੇ ਬੈਠੇ ਰਹੀਏ।","unitId":"pauri01","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri01.line03","english":"Craving is not satisfied even by gathering the wealth of many worlds.","punjabi":"ਤ੍ਰਿਸ਼ਨਾ ਦੀ ਭੁੱਖ ਨਹੀਂ ਮੁੱਕਦੀ, ਭਾਵੇਂ ਕਈ ਲੋਕਾਂ ਜਿਤਨਾ ਧਨ ਇਕੱਠਾ ਕਰ ਲਈਏ।","unitId":"pauri01","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri01.line04","english":"Even thousands upon thousands of clever strategies cannot accompany us as the answer.","punjabi":"ਹਜ਼ਾਰਾਂ-ਲੱਖਾਂ ਚਤੁਰਾਈਆਂ ਹੋਣ, ਫਿਰ ਵੀ ਕੋਈ ਇਸ ਮੰਜ਼ਿਲ ਤੱਕ ਸਾਥ ਨਹੀਂ ਨਿਭਾਉਂਦੀ।","unitId":"pauri01","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri01.line05","english":"How, then, can we become truthful? How can the barrier of falsehood break?","punjabi":"ਫਿਰ ਸੱਚ ਨਾਲ ਜੀਉਣ ਵਾਲੇ ਕਿਵੇਂ ਬਣੀਏ? ਕੂੜ ਦੀ ਕੰਧ ਕਿਵੇਂ ਟੁੱਟੇ?","unitId":"pauri01","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri01.line06","english":"Nanak: live in accord with the Hukam of the One whose will sustains all; it is written with our very existence.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ: ਰਜ਼ਾ ਦੇ ਮਾਲਕ ਦੇ ਹੁਕਮ ਵਿੱਚ ਤੁਰਨਾ ਹੈ; ਇਹ ਹੁਕਮ ਸਾਡੇ ਹੋਣ ਦੇ ਨਾਲ ਹੀ ਲਿਖਿਆ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri01","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri02.line01","english":"Forms come into being through Hukam; Hukam cannot be fully expressed in words.","punjabi":"ਹੁਕਮ ਅਨੁਸਾਰ ਸਾਰੇ ਰੂਪ ਬਣਦੇ ਹਨ; ਉਸ ਹੁਕਮ ਨੂੰ ਪੂਰੀ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਬਿਆਨ ਨਹੀਂ ਕੀਤਾ ਜਾ ਸਕਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri02","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri02.line02","english":"Living beings arise through Hukam; through Hukam, honour is received.","punjabi":"ਹੁਕਮ ਅਨੁਸਾਰ ਜੀਵ ਹੋਂਦ ਵਿਚ ਆਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਹੁਕਮ ਵਿਚ ਹੀ ਵਡਿਆਈ ਮਿਲਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri02","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri02.line03","english":"High and low, and the experience of suffering and comfort, are within Hukam.","punjabi":"ਉੱਚਾ-ਨੀਵਾਂ ਹੋਣਾ ਅਤੇ ਲਿਖੇ ਅਨੁਸਾਰ ਦੁੱਖ-ਸੁੱਖ ਭੋਗਣਾ ਵੀ ਹੁਕਮ ਦੇ ਅੰਦਰ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri02","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri02.line04","english":"Within Hukam, some receive grace; within Hukam, others continue to wander in the cycle of birth and death.","punjabi":"ਹੁਕਮ ਵਿਚ ਕਈਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਬਖ਼ਸ਼ਸ਼ ਮਿਲਦੀ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਕਈ ਜਨਮ-ਮਰਨ ਦੇ ਗੇੜ ਵਿਚ ਭਟਕਦੇ ਰਹਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri02","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri02.line05","english":"Everyone is within Hukam; no one is outside it.","punjabi":"ਹਰੇਕ ਜੀਵ ਹੁਕਮ ਦੇ ਅੰਦਰ ਹੈ; ਕੋਈ ਵੀ ਉਸ ਤੋਂ ਬਾਹਰ ਨਹੀਂ।","unitId":"pauri02","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri02.line06","english":"O Nanak, one who understands Hukam no longer speaks from haumai—from self-centred “I-ness”.","punjabi":"ਹੇ ਨਾਨਕ! ਜੋ ਹੁਕਮ ਨੂੰ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਂਦਾ ਹੈ, ਉਹ ਹਉਮੈ ਦੀਆਂ ਗੱਲਾਂ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri02","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri03.line01","english":"Some praise divine strength, as their own capacity allows.","punjabi":"ਕੋਈ ਆਪਣੀ ਸਮਰੱਥਾ ਅਨੁਸਾਰ ਕਰਤਾਰ ਦੀ ਤਾਕਤ ਦਾ ਜਸ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri03","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri03.line02","english":"Some recognize the gifts as signs of the Giver and sing of them.","punjabi":"ਕੋਈ ਦਾਤਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਦਾਤਾਰ ਦੀ ਨਿਸ਼ਾਨੀ ਜਾਣ ਕੇ ਗਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri03","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri03.line03","english":"Some praise the beautiful qualities and greatness of the One.","punjabi":"ਕੋਈ ਕਰਤਾਰ ਦੇ ਸੋਹਣੇ ਗੁਣ ਅਤੇ ਵਡਿਆਈਆਂ ਗਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri03","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri03.line04","english":"Some approach that difficult understanding through learning and reflection.","punjabi":"ਕੋਈ ਵਿੱਦਿਆ ਤੇ ਡੂੰਘੀ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਨਾਲ ਉਸ ਔਖੀ ਸਮਝ ਨੂੰ ਗਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri03","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri03.line05","english":"Some sing of the One who forms the body and returns it to dust.","punjabi":"ਕੋਈ ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਗਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ ਜੋ ਸਰੀਰ ਰਚਦਾ ਅਤੇ ਫਿਰ ਮਿੱਟੀ ਕਰ ਦਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri03","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri03.line06","english":"Some sing of the One who takes life and gives life again.","punjabi":"ਕੋਈ ਉਸ ਦਾ ਜਸ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ ਜੋ ਜੀਵਨ ਲੈਂਦਾ ਤੇ ਮੁੜ ਜੀਵਨ ਦਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri03","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri03.line07","english":"To some, the One they praise seems far away.","punjabi":"ਕਿਸੇ ਨੂੰ ਜਿਸ ਕਰਤਾਰ ਦਾ ਉਹ ਜਸ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ, ਉਹ ਦੂਰ ਜਾਪਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri03","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri03.line08","english":"Others sing of the One seen as present here, watching everywhere.","punjabi":"ਕੋਈ ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਹਰ ਥਾਂ ਹਾਜ਼ਰ ਅਤੇ ਵੇਖਣ ਵਾਲਾ ਜਾਣ ਕੇ ਗਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri03","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri03.line09","english":"Such accounts and descriptions never reach an end.","punjabi":"ਇਹ ਕਹਾਣੀਆਂ ਅਤੇ ਵਰਣਨ ਮੁੱਕਣ ਵਿੱਚ ਨਹੀਂ ਆਉਂਦੇ।","unitId":"pauri03","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri03.line10","english":"Multitudes have spoken and spoken again, beyond counting.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਜੀਵ ਬੇਅੰਤ ਵਾਰ ਆਖਦੇ ਅਤੇ ਵਰਣਨ ਕਰਦੇ ਆਏ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri03","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri03.line11","english":"The Giver continues giving; it is the receivers who become weary.","punjabi":"ਦਾਤਾਰ ਦਿੰਦਾ ਹੀ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ; ਲੈਣ ਵਾਲੇ ਲੈਂਦਿਆਂ ਥੱਕ ਜਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri03","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri03.line12","english":"Age after age, beings keep living on those gifts.","punjabi":"ਜੁਗਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਜੀਵ ਉਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਦਾਤਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਵਰਤਦੇ ਅਤੇ ਖਾਂਦੇ ਆ ਰਹੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri03","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri03.line13","english":"The Ordainer's Hukam keeps the course of creation moving.","punjabi":"ਹੁਕਮ ਦੇ ਮਾਲਕ ਦਾ ਹੁਕਮ ਹੀ ਸ੍ਰਿਸ਼ਟੀ ਦੀ ਕਾਰ ਚਲਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri03","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri03.line14","english":"Nanak: the One flourishes, free from anxiety or dependence.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ: ਉਹ ਕਰਤਾਰ ਚਿੰਤਾ ਤੋਂ ਪਰੇ, ਸਦਾ ਖਿੜਿਆ ਹੋਇਆ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri03","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri04.line01","english":"The Sovereign is enduring; the divine order is enduring, and love is its boundless language.","punjabi":"ਮਾਲਕ ਸਦਾ-ਥਿਰ ਹੈ; ਉਸ ਦਾ ਨਿਯਮ ਅਟੱਲ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਉਸ ਦੀ ਬੋਲੀ ਬੇਅੰਤ ਪ੍ਰੇਮ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri04","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri04.line02","english":"Beings keep asking, 'Give, give'; the generous One keeps bestowing.","punjabi":"ਜੀਵ ਮੁੜ-ਮੁੜ ਦਾਤਾਂ ਮੰਗਦੇ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਦਾਤਾਰ ਬਖ਼ਸ਼ਦਾ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri04","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri04.line03","english":"Then what offering could we bring that opens a glimpse of the divine court?","punjabi":"ਫਿਰ ਅਸੀਂ ਕੀ ਭੇਟ ਰੱਖੀਏ ਜਿਸ ਨਾਲ ਉਸ ਦੇ ਦਰ ਦੀ ਝਲਕ ਮਿਲੇ?","unitId":"pauri04","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri04.line04","english":"What could we say that would be heard in a relationship of love?","punjabi":"ਅਸੀਂ ਕਿਹੋ ਜਿਹੇ ਬੋਲ ਬੋਲੀਏ ਜਿਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਸੁਣ ਕੇ ਉਹ ਪਿਆਰ ਧਰੇ?","unitId":"pauri04","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri04.line05","english":"In Amrit Vela, remember the enduring Naam and contemplate divine greatness.","punjabi":"ਅੰਮ੍ਰਿਤ ਵੇਲੇ ਸਦਾ-ਥਿਰ ਨਾਮ ਦੀ ਯਾਦ ਅਤੇ ਕਰਤਾਰ ਦੀ ਵਡਿਆਈ ਦੀ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰੀਏ।","unitId":"pauri04","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri04.line06","english":"In one reading, grace clothes us in praise; the gracious gaze opens liberation. Study explains the alternative body-and-deeds reading.","punjabi":"ਇੱਕ ਵਿਆਖਿਆ ਅਨੁਸਾਰ ਮਿਹਰ ਨਾਲ ਸਿਫ਼ਤਿ ਦਾ ਪਟੋਲਾ ਮਿਲਦਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਕਿਰਪਾ ਨਾਲ ਮੁਕਤੀ ਦਾ ਦਰ ਖੁੱਲ੍ਹਦਾ ਹੈ। ਦੇਹ ਤੇ ਕਰਮ ਵਾਲੀ ਵਿਆਖਿਆ ਅਧਿਐਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri04","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri04.line07","english":"Nanak: in this way, recognize the enduring One as present throughout.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ: ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਸਮਝ ਆਉਂਦੀ ਹੈ ਕਿ ਸਦਾ-ਥਿਰ ਕਰਤਾਰ ਸਭ ਥਾਂ ਆਪ ਹੀ ਵੱਸਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri04","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri05.line01","english":"The One cannot be installed into existence or made by us.","punjabi":"ਕਰਤਾਰ ਨੂੰ ਅਸੀਂ ਥਾਪ ਕੇ ਹੋਂਦ ਵਿੱਚ ਨਹੀਂ ਲਿਆ ਸਕਦੇ, ਨਾ ਆਪਣਾ ਬਣਾਇਆ ਬਣਾ ਸਕਦੇ ਹਾਂ।","unitId":"pauri05","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri05.line02","english":"That One exists of itself, untouched by stain.","punjabi":"ਉਹ ਆਪ ਹੀ ਆਪਣੇ ਆਪ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਮੈਲ ਦੇ ਪ੍ਰਭਾਵ ਤੋਂ ਪਰੇ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri05","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri05.line03","english":"Whoever has served the One has found true honor.","punjabi":"ਜਿਸ ਨੇ ਉਸ ਦੀ ਸੇਵਾ ਕੀਤੀ, ਉਸ ਨੇ ਅਸਲ ਮਾਣ ਪਾਇਆ।","unitId":"pauri05","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri05.line04","english":"Nanak: let us praise the inexhaustible source of qualities.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ: ਆਓ, ਗੁਣਾਂ ਦੇ ਖ਼ਜ਼ਾਨੇ ਦਾ ਜਸ ਕਰੀਏ।","unitId":"pauri05","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri05.line05","english":"Let praise and listening be joined with love held in the mind.","punjabi":"ਗਾਈਏ ਵੀ, ਸੁਣੀਏ ਵੀ ਅਤੇ ਮਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਪ੍ਰੇਮ ਟਿਕਾਈਏ।","unitId":"pauri05","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri05.line06","english":"In this way, sorrow is set aside and peace is brought within.","punjabi":"ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਦੁੱਖ ਦੂਰ ਕਰਕੇ ਅੰਦਰ ਸੁੱਖ ਵਸਾਇਆ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri05","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri05.line07","english":"Through the Guru come the sacred resonance, wisdom and recognition of the One pervading all.","punjabi":"ਗੁਰੂ ਰਾਹੀਂ ਨਾਮ ਦੀ ਧੁਨ, ਗਿਆਨ ਅਤੇ ਸਭ ਵਿੱਚ ਵਿਆਪਕ ਕਰਤਾਰ ਦੀ ਸੂਝ ਮਿਲਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri05","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri05.line08","english":"For the learner, the Guru is the guide invoked here as Shiva, Gorakh, Brahma and Mother Parvati.","punjabi":"ਇਥੇ ਸਿੱਖ ਲਈ ਗੁਰੂ ਨੂੰ ਹੀ ਈਸਰ, ਗੋਰਖ, ਬਰਮਾ ਅਤੇ ਮਾਈ ਪਾਰਬਤੀ ਆਖਿਆ ਗਿਆ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri05","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri05.line09","english":"Even if I came to understand, I could not fully put that reality into words.","punjabi":"ਜੇ ਮੈਂ ਸਮਝ ਵੀ ਲਵਾਂ, ਤਾਂ ਵੀ ਉਸ ਦਾ ਪੂਰਾ ਵਰਣਨ ਬੋਲਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰ ਸਕਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri05","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri05.line10","english":"O Guru, grant me this one understanding—","punjabi":"ਹੇ ਗੁਰੂ, ਮੈਨੂੰ ਇਹ ਇੱਕ ਸਮਝ ਬਖ਼ਸ਼ੋ—","unitId":"pauri05","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri05.line11","english":"There is one Giver for every being; may I not forget that One.","punjabi":"ਸਾਰੇ ਜੀਵਾਂ ਦਾ ਦਾਤਾਰ ਇੱਕ ਹੈ; ਉਹ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਨਾ ਭੁੱਲੇ।","unitId":"pauri05","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri06.line01","english":"What would bathing at a sacred place accomplish unless it were pleasing to the One?","punjabi":"ਜੇ ਕਰਤਾਰ ਨੂੰ ਨਾ ਭਾਵਾਂ, ਤਾਂ ਤੀਰਥ ਉੱਤੇ ਇਸ਼ਨਾਨ ਕਰਕੇ ਕੀ ਖੱਟਾਂ?","unitId":"pauri06","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri06.line02","english":"Across all the creation I see, what can be received apart from grace?","punjabi":"ਜਿੰਨੀ ਰਚਨਾ ਮੈਂ ਵੇਖਦਾ ਹਾਂ, ਮਿਹਰ ਤੋਂ ਬਿਨਾ ਉਸ ਵਿੱਚ ਕੀ ਮਿਲ ਜਾਂ ਲਿਆ ਜਾ ਸਕਦਾ ਹੈ?","unitId":"pauri06","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri06.line03","english":"Understanding holds precious jewels when even one teaching of the Guru is truly heard.","punjabi":"ਗੁਰੂ ਦੀ ਇੱਕ ਸਿੱਖਿਆ ਵੀ ਮਨ ਲਾ ਕੇ ਸੁਣੀ ਜਾਵੇ ਤਾਂ ਮਤਿ ਵਿੱਚ ਰਤਨਾਂ ਵਰਗੀ ਸੂਝ ਉੱਭਰਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri06","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri06.line04","english":"O Guru, grant me this one understanding—","punjabi":"ਹੇ ਗੁਰੂ, ਮੈਨੂੰ ਇਹ ਇੱਕ ਸਮਝ ਬਖ਼ਸ਼ੋ—","unitId":"pauri06","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri06.line05","english":"There is one Giver for every being; may I not forget that One.","punjabi":"ਸਾਰੇ ਜੀਵਾਂ ਦਾ ਦਾਤਾਰ ਇੱਕ ਹੈ; ਉਹ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਨਾ ਭੁੱਲੇ।","unitId":"pauri06","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri07.line01","english":"Imagine a lifespan as long as the four ages, and ten times longer still—","punjabi":"ਭਾਵੇਂ ਉਮਰ ਚਾਰ ਜੁਗਾਂ ਜਿੰਨੀ ਹੋਵੇ, ਫਿਰ ਉਸ ਤੋਂ ਵੀ ਦਸ ਗੁਣਾ ਵੱਧ ਹੋ ਜਾਵੇ—","unitId":"pauri07","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri07.line02","english":"Known throughout the world's regions, with everyone following along—","punjabi":"ਸਾਰੇ ਜਗਤ ਵਿੱਚ ਜਾਣਿਆ ਜਾਵੇ ਅਤੇ ਹਰ ਕੋਈ ਨਾਲ ਤੁਰੇ—","unitId":"pauri07","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri07.line03","english":"Having won a celebrated name, praise and renown in the world—","punjabi":"ਚੰਗਾ ਨਾਮ ਖੱਟ ਕੇ ਜਗਤ ਵਿੱਚ ਜਸ ਅਤੇ ਸ਼ੋਭਾ ਵੀ ਮਿਲ ਜਾਵੇ—","unitId":"pauri07","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri07.line04","english":"Without the gracious gaze, that reputation does not secure one's standing.","punjabi":"ਪਰ ਮਿਹਰ ਦੀ ਨਜ਼ਰ ਤੋਂ ਬਿਨਾ ਉਸ ਨਾਮਣੇ ਨਾਲ ਅਸਲ ਪਤਿ ਕਾਇਮ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੁੰਦੀ।","unitId":"pauri07","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri07.line05","english":"One may still be reckoned tiny among the tiniest and answerable for one's faults.","punjabi":"ਫਿਰ ਵੀ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਬਹੁਤ ਛੋਟਾ ਠਹਿਰਦਾ ਅਤੇ ਆਪਣੇ ਦੋਸਾਂ ਲਈ ਦੋਸੀ ਮੰਨਿਆ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri07","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri07.line06","english":"Nanak: the One gives qualities to the lacking and enriches those who already have them.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ: ਕਰਤਾਰ ਗੁਣਹੀਣ ਵਿੱਚ ਗੁਣ ਉਪਜਾਉਂਦਾ ਅਤੇ ਗੁਣਵਾਨ ਨੂੰ ਵੀ ਹੋਰ ਗੁਣ ਦਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri07","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri07.line07","english":"No other appears able to bestow qualities in that way.","punjabi":"ਅਜਿਹਾ ਹੋਰ ਕੋਈ ਨਹੀਂ ਦਿੱਸਦਾ ਜੋ ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਗੁਣਾਂ ਦੀ ਦਾਤ ਦੇ ਸਕੇ।","unitId":"pauri07","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri08.line01","english":"Through deep listening, one grows into the wisdom associated with siddhas, pirs, devas and naths.","punjabi":"ਧਿਆਨ ਨਾਲ ਨਾਮ ਸੁਣਨ ਤੋਂ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਨੂੰ ਸਿੱਧਾਂ, ਪੀਰਾਂ, ਦੇਵਾਂ ਅਤੇ ਨਾਥਾਂ ਵਰਗੀ ਆਤਮਕ ਸੂਝ ਮਿਲਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri08","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri08.line02","english":"Listening opens understanding of earth, its support and the sky.","punjabi":"ਸੁਣਨ ਨਾਲ ਧਰਤੀ, ਉਸ ਦੇ ਆਸਰੇ ਅਤੇ ਅਕਾਸ਼ ਦੀ ਸਮਝ ਖੁੱਲ੍ਹਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri08","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri08.line03","english":"Listening opens a horizon of lands, worlds and depths.","punjabi":"ਸੁਣਨ ਨਾਲ ਦੀਪਾਂ, ਲੋਕਾਂ ਅਤੇ ਪਾਤਾਲਾਂ ਦੀ ਵਿਸ਼ਾਲਤਾ ਵੱਲ ਸੁਰਤਿ ਖੁੱਲ੍ਹਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri08","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri08.line04","english":"In such listening, death's grip cannot overwhelm the devotee's spirit.","punjabi":"ਅਜਿਹੇ ਸੁਣਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਕਾਲ ਦੀ ਪਕੜ ਭਗਤ ਦੀ ਆਤਮਕ ਅਵਸਥਾ ਨੂੰ ਵੱਸ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰ ਸਕਦੀ।","unitId":"pauri08","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri08.line05","english":"Nanak: the devotees remain inwardly flourishing.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ: ਭਗਤਾਂ ਦੇ ਅੰਦਰ ਸਦਾ ਖਿੜਾਉ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri08","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri08.line06","english":"Such listening breaks the hold of suffering and wrongdoing.","punjabi":"ਅਜਿਹਾ ਸੁਣਨਾ ਦੁੱਖ ਅਤੇ ਪਾਪ ਦੀ ਪਕੜ ਤੋੜਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri08","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri09.line01","english":"Through listening comes the spiritual understanding associated with Shiva, Brahma and Indra.","punjabi":"ਸੁਣਨ ਨਾਲ ਈਸਰ, ਬਰਮਾ ਅਤੇ ਇੰਦ੍ਰ ਵਰਗੀ ਆਤਮਕ ਸੂਝ ਮਿਲਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri09","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri09.line02","english":"Through listening, even one living badly turns their speech toward praise.","punjabi":"ਸੁਣਨ ਨਾਲ ਮੰਦੇ ਜੀਵਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਵੀ ਮੂੰਹੋਂ ਸਿਫ਼ਤਿ ਕਰਨ ਵੱਲ ਮੁੜਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri09","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri09.line03","english":"Listening opens insight into the way of union and the mystery within the body.","punjabi":"ਸੁਣਨ ਨਾਲ ਜੋਗ ਦੀ ਜੁਗਤਿ ਅਤੇ ਸਰੀਰ ਦੇ ਅੰਦਰਲੇ ਭੇਦ ਦੀ ਸੂਝ ਮਿਲਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri09","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri09.line04","english":"Listening gives entry into the wisdom sought through the Shastras, Smritis and Vedas.","punjabi":"ਸੁਣਨ ਨਾਲ ਸਾਸਤਰਾਂ, ਸਿਮ੍ਰਿਤੀਆਂ ਅਤੇ ਵੇਦਾਂ ਰਾਹੀਂ ਲੱਭੇ ਜਾਂਦੇ ਗਿਆਨ ਦੀ ਸੂਝ ਖੁੱਲ੍ਹਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri09","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri09.line05","english":"Nanak: the devotees remain inwardly flourishing.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ: ਭਗਤਾਂ ਦੇ ਅੰਦਰ ਸਦਾ ਖਿੜਾਉ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri09","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri09.line06","english":"Such listening breaks the hold of suffering and wrongdoing.","punjabi":"ਅਜਿਹਾ ਸੁਣਨਾ ਦੁੱਖ ਅਤੇ ਪਾਪ ਦੀ ਪਕੜ ਤੋੜਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri09","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri10.line01","english":"Listening nurtures generosity, contentment and understanding.","punjabi":"ਸੁਣਨ ਨਾਲ ਦਾਨੀ ਸੁਭਾਉ, ਸੰਤੋਖ ਅਤੇ ਗਿਆਨ ਉਪਜਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri10","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri10.line02","english":"Its cleansing is pictured as the bathing of sixty-eight pilgrimage places.","punjabi":"ਇਸ ਦੀ ਅੰਦਰਲੀ ਸੁੱਚਤਾ ਨੂੰ ਅਠਾਹਠ ਤੀਰਥਾਂ ਦੇ ਇਸ਼ਨਾਨ ਦੀ ਤਸਵੀਰ ਨਾਲ ਸਮਝਾਇਆ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri10","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri10.line03","english":"Listening brings the honor that others seek through long study.","punjabi":"ਸੁਣਨ ਨਾਲ ਉਹ ਮਾਣ ਮਿਲਦਾ ਹੈ ਜੋ ਹੋਰ ਬਹੁਤ ਪੜ੍ਹ ਕੇ ਲੱਭਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri10","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri10.line04","english":"Listening allows attention to settle in natural steadiness.","punjabi":"ਸੁਣਨ ਨਾਲ ਧਿਆਨ ਸਹਜ ਅਡੋਲਤਾ ਵਿੱਚ ਟਿਕਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri10","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri10.line05","english":"Nanak: the devotees remain inwardly flourishing.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ: ਭਗਤਾਂ ਦੇ ਅੰਦਰ ਸਦਾ ਖਿੜਾਉ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri10","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri10.line06","english":"Such listening breaks the hold of suffering and wrongdoing.","punjabi":"ਅਜਿਹਾ ਸੁਣਨਾ ਦੁੱਖ ਅਤੇ ਪਾਪ ਦੀ ਪਕੜ ਤੋੜਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri10","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri11.line01","english":"Listening leads one into the depths of the reservoirs of virtues.","punjabi":"ਸੁਣਨ ਨਾਲ ਗੁਣਾਂ ਦੇ ਸਰੋਵਰਾਂ ਦੀ ਡੂੰਘਾਈ ਵਿੱਚ ਉਤਰਿਆ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri11","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri11.line02","english":"Listening brings an inward dignity likened to that of shaikhs, pirs and sovereigns.","punjabi":"ਸੁਣਨ ਨਾਲ ਸ਼ੇਖਾਂ, ਪੀਰਾਂ ਅਤੇ ਪਾਤਸ਼ਾਹਾਂ ਵਰਗੀ ਅੰਦਰਲੀ ਪਤਿ ਮਿਲਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri11","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri11.line03","english":"Through listening, those without understanding find a way.","punjabi":"ਸੁਣਨ ਨਾਲ ਸੂਝ ਤੋਂ ਵਾਂਝਿਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਵੀ ਰਾਹ ਮਿਲਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri11","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri11.line04","english":"Listening gives a sounding of what seemed unfathomable.","punjabi":"ਸੁਣਨ ਨਾਲ ਜੋ ਅਥਾਹ ਲੱਗਦਾ ਸੀ, ਉਸ ਦੀ ਥਾਹ ਦੀ ਸਮਝ ਆਉਂਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri11","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri11.line05","english":"Nanak: the devotees remain inwardly flourishing.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ: ਭਗਤਾਂ ਦੇ ਅੰਦਰ ਸਦਾ ਖਿੜਾਉ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri11","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri11.line06","english":"Such listening breaks the hold of suffering and wrongdoing.","punjabi":"ਅਜਿਹਾ ਸੁਣਨਾ ਦੁੱਖ ਅਤੇ ਪਾਪ ਦੀ ਪਕੜ ਤੋੜਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri11","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri12.line01","english":"The state of one whose trust is established cannot be fully described.","punjabi":"ਜਿਸ ਦਾ ਮਨ ਨਾਮ ਵਿੱਚ ਪਤੀਜਿਆ ਹੈ, ਉਸ ਦੀ ਅਵਸਥਾ ਪੂਰੀ ਕਹੀ ਨਹੀਂ ਜਾ ਸਕਦੀ।","unitId":"pauri12","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri12.line02","english":"Anyone trying to contain it in words later regrets the inadequacy.","punjabi":"ਜੋ ਇਸ ਨੂੰ ਪੂਰਾ ਬੋਲਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ ਬੰਨ੍ਹਣਾ ਚਾਹੇ, ਉਹ ਪਿੱਛੋਂ ਆਪਣੇ ਅਧੂਰੇ ਵਰਣਨ ਉੱਤੇ ਪਛਤਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri12","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri12.line03","english":"Neither paper and pen nor a writer can encompass it—","punjabi":"ਕਾਗਜ਼, ਕਲਮ ਅਤੇ ਲਿਖਾਰੀ ਵੀ ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਪੂਰਾ ਨਹੀਂ ਸਮੇਟ ਸਕਦੇ—","unitId":"pauri12","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri12.line04","english":"Though people sit together to consider the life of the one who trusts.","punjabi":"ਭਾਵੇਂ ਲੋਕ ਬੈਠ ਕੇ ਪਤੀਜੇ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਦੀ ਅਵਸਥਾ ਬਾਰੇ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri12","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri12.line05","english":"Such is Naam, free of stain and entanglement.","punjabi":"ਨਾਮ ਅਜਿਹਾ ਹੈ—ਮੈਲ ਅਤੇ ਮਾਇਆ ਦੀ ਪਕੜ ਤੋਂ ਪਰੇ।","unitId":"pauri12","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri12.line06","english":"One comes to know this by accepting it inwardly, in one's own mind.","punjabi":"ਇਹ ਗੱਲ ਆਪਣੇ ਮਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਲਗਨ ਤੇ ਭਰੋਸਾ ਧਾਰ ਕੇ ਜਾਣੀ ਜਾਂਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri12","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri13.line01","english":"With inward acceptance, awareness and discernment awaken.","punjabi":"ਨਾਮ ਵਿੱਚ ਮਨ ਪਤੀਜਣ ਨਾਲ ਸੁਰਤਿ ਅਤੇ ਬੁੱਧਿ ਜਾਗਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri13","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri13.line02","english":"Acceptance opens an understanding extending across all the worlds.","punjabi":"ਪਤੀਜਣ ਨਾਲ ਸਾਰੇ ਭਵਨਾਂ ਵੱਲ ਫੈਲੀ ਹੋਈ ਸੂਝ ਖੁੱਲ੍ਹਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri13","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri13.line03","english":"Such acceptance keeps the person from the blows of spiritual degradation.","punjabi":"ਅਜਿਹਾ ਮੰਨਣਾ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਨੂੰ ਆਤਮਕ ਪਤਨ ਦੀਆਂ ਚੋਟਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਬਚਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri13","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri13.line04","english":"The one who accepts is not carried away in the company of the death-messenger.","punjabi":"ਨਾਮ ਵਿੱਚ ਪਤੀਜਿਆ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਜਮ ਦੇ ਸਾਥ ਨਹੀਂ ਜਾਂਦਾ—ਇਹ ਮੁਕਤੀ ਦੀ ਆਤਮਕ ਭਾਸ਼ਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri13","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri13.line05","english":"Such is Naam, free of stain and entanglement.","punjabi":"ਨਾਮ ਅਜਿਹਾ ਹੈ—ਮੈਲ ਅਤੇ ਮਾਇਆ ਦੀ ਪਕੜ ਤੋਂ ਪਰੇ।","unitId":"pauri13","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri13.line06","english":"One comes to know this by accepting it inwardly, in one's own mind.","punjabi":"ਇਹ ਗੱਲ ਆਪਣੇ ਮਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਲਗਨ ਤੇ ਭਰੋਸਾ ਧਾਰ ਕੇ ਜਾਣੀ ਜਾਂਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri13","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri14.line01","english":"Inward acceptance keeps obstruction from breaking the spiritual path.","punjabi":"ਨਾਮ ਵਿੱਚ ਪਤੀਜਣ ਨਾਲ ਰੋਕ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਨੂੰ ਆਤਮਕ ਰਾਹ ਤੋਂ ਤੋੜ ਨਹੀਂ ਸਕਦੀ।","unitId":"pauri14","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri14.line02","english":"The person of acceptance goes forward openly, with dignity.","punjabi":"ਪਤੀਜਿਆ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਪਤਿ ਅਤੇ ਪ੍ਰਗਟ ਮਾਣ ਨਾਲ ਅੱਗੇ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri14","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri14.line03","english":"Such a person does not wander from route to route in spiritual uncertainty.","punjabi":"ਅਜਿਹਾ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਆਤਮਕ ਦੁਬਿਧਾ ਵਿੱਚ ਰਾਹਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਰਾਹਾਂ ਵੱਲ ਨਹੀਂ ਭਟਕਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri14","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri14.line04","english":"Acceptance forms a living relationship with dharam.","punjabi":"ਮੰਨਣ ਨਾਲ ਧਰਮ ਦੇ ਨਾਲ ਜੀਉਂਦਾ ਸੰਬੰਧ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri14","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri14.line05","english":"Such is Naam, free of stain and entanglement.","punjabi":"ਨਾਮ ਅਜਿਹਾ ਹੈ—ਮੈਲ ਅਤੇ ਮਾਇਆ ਦੀ ਪਕੜ ਤੋਂ ਪਰੇ।","unitId":"pauri14","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri14.line06","english":"One comes to know this by accepting it inwardly, in one's own mind.","punjabi":"ਇਹ ਗੱਲ ਆਪਣੇ ਮਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਲਗਨ ਤੇ ਭਰੋਸਾ ਧਾਰ ਕੇ ਜਾਣੀ ਜਾਂਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri14","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri15.line01","english":"Through acceptance, the doorway of liberation is found.","punjabi":"ਨਾਮ ਵਿੱਚ ਪਤੀਜਣ ਨਾਲ ਮੁਕਤੀ ਦਾ ਦਰ ਲੱਭਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri15","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri15.line02","english":"Through acceptance, the family also receives sustaining support.","punjabi":"ਇਸ ਪਤੀਜਣ ਨਾਲ ਪਰਵਾਰ ਨੂੰ ਵੀ ਟਿਕਾਊ ਆਸਰਾ ਮਿਲਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri15","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri15.line03","english":"Through acceptance, the Guru crosses and carries disciples across.","punjabi":"ਮੰਨਣ ਨਾਲ ਗੁਰੂ ਤਰਦਾ ਅਤੇ ਸਿੱਖਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਵੀ ਪਾਰ ਲੰਘਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri15","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri15.line04","english":"Nanak: those who accept do not wander begging for spiritual support elsewhere.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ: ਪਤੀਜੇ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਆਤਮਕ ਆਸਰੇ ਲਈ ਦਰ-ਦਰ ਭਿੱਖ ਮੰਗਦੇ ਨਹੀਂ ਭਟਕਦੇ।","unitId":"pauri15","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri15.line05","english":"Such is Naam, free of stain and entanglement.","punjabi":"ਨਾਮ ਅਜਿਹਾ ਹੈ—ਮੈਲ ਅਤੇ ਮਾਇਆ ਦੀ ਪਕੜ ਤੋਂ ਪਰੇ।","unitId":"pauri15","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri15.line06","english":"One comes to know this by accepting it inwardly, in one's own mind.","punjabi":"ਇਹ ਗੱਲ ਆਪਣੇ ਮਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਲਗਨ ਤੇ ਭਰੋਸਾ ਧਾਰ ਕੇ ਜਾਣੀ ਜਾਂਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri15","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line01","english":"The spiritually accepted ones are esteemed and foremost.","punjabi":"ਨਾਮ ਵਿੱਚ ਟਿਕੇ ਪਰਵਾਣ ਜਨ ਮਾਣਯੋਗ ਅਤੇ ਅਗਵਾਈ ਵਾਲੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line02","english":"Those accepted ones receive honor in the divine court.","punjabi":"ਉਹ ਪਰਵਾਣ ਜਨ ਕਰਤਾਰ ਦੀ ਦਰਗਾਹ ਵਿੱਚ ਮਾਣ ਪਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line03","english":"They stand in dignity at the Sovereign's doorway.","punjabi":"ਉਹ ਪਾਤਸ਼ਾਹ ਦੇ ਦਰ ਉੱਤੇ ਸੋਭਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line04","english":"Their attention rests on the one Guru.","punjabi":"ਉਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਦੀ ਸੁਰਤਿ ਦਾ ਕੇਂਦਰ ਇੱਕ ਗੁਰੂ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line05","english":"Even if someone tries to speak and reflect upon it—","punjabi":"ਭਾਵੇਂ ਕੋਈ ਉਸ ਬਾਰੇ ਕਹਿਣ ਅਤੇ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰਨ ਦਾ ਜਤਨ ਕਰੇ—","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line06","english":"The Creator's work has no total that can be counted.","punjabi":"ਕਰਤਾਰ ਦੀ ਰਚਨਾ ਦਾ ਪੂਰਾ ਹਿਸਾਬ ਨਹੀਂ ਲਾਇਆ ਜਾ ਸਕਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line07","english":"The supporting bull is pictured as dharam, born of compassion.","punjabi":"ਸਹਾਰਾ ਦੇਣ ਵਾਲੇ ਧੌਲ ਨੂੰ ਧਰਮ, ਅਤੇ ਧਰਮ ਨੂੰ ਦਇਆ ਦਾ ਪੁੱਤਰ ਦਰਸਾਇਆ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line08","english":"Through that ordering, contentment is established and held in harmony.","punjabi":"ਉਸ ਮਰਯਾਦਾ ਰਾਹੀਂ ਸੰਤੋਖ ਟਿਕਾਇਆ ਅਤੇ ਇਕਸਾਰਤਾ ਵਿੱਚ ਰੱਖਿਆ ਗਿਆ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line09","english":"Understanding this makes one fit for a truthful life.","punjabi":"ਇਹ ਸਮਝ ਆਵੇ ਤਾਂ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਸੱਚਾ ਜੀਵਨ ਜੀਉਣ ਯੋਗ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line10","english":"But imagine the immense weight placed upon a literal bull.","punjabi":"ਪਰ ਜੇ ਸੱਚਮੁੱਚ ਬਲਦ ਮੰਨੀਏ, ਤਾਂ ਉਸ ਉੱਤੇ ਕਿੰਨਾ ਭਾਰ ਹੋਵੇਗਾ!","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line11","english":"What supports that support—another earth, and then another beyond it?","punjabi":"ਉਸ ਆਸਰੇ ਹੇਠ ਕੀ ਹੋਵੇਗਾ—ਹੋਰ ਧਰਤੀ, ਫਿਰ ਉਸ ਤੋਂ ਪਰੇ ਹੋਰ ਆਸਰਾ?","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line12","english":"What power underneath would finally carry all that weight?","punjabi":"ਅੰਤ ਵਿੱਚ ਉਸ ਸਾਰੇ ਭਾਰ ਹੇਠ ਕਿਹੜਾ ਬਲ ਆਸਰਾ ਦੇਵੇਗਾ?","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line13","english":"Living beings have countless kinds, colors and names.","punjabi":"ਜੀਵਾਂ ਦੀਆਂ ਅਨੇਕ ਕਿਸਮਾਂ, ਰੰਗ ਅਤੇ ਨਾਮ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line14","english":"All are inscribed by a pen that flows without stopping.","punjabi":"ਸਭਨਾਂ ਦਾ ਲੇਖ ਲਗਾਤਾਰ ਚੱਲਦੀ ਕਲਮ ਨਾਲ ਲਿਖਿਆ ਗਿਆ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line15","english":"Who could truly know how to write that complete account?","punjabi":"ਉਹ ਪੂਰਾ ਹਿਸਾਬ ਲਿਖਣਾ ਕੌਣ ਜਾਣ ਸਕਦਾ ਹੈ?","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line16","english":"And how vast would that account become if it were written?","punjabi":"ਜੇ ਉਹ ਹਿਸਾਬ ਲਿਖਿਆ ਜਾਵੇ, ਤਾਂ ਕਿੰਨਾ ਵਿਸ਼ਾਲ ਹੋਵੇਗਾ!","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line17","english":"How immense the power; how beautiful the forms!","punjabi":"ਕਿੰਨੀ ਵੱਡੀ ਤਾਕਤ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਕਿੰਨੇ ਸੋਹਣੇ ਰੂਪ ਹਨ!","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line18","english":"How abundant the giving—who could measure it?","punjabi":"ਕਿੰਨੀਆਂ ਬੇਅੰਤ ਦਾਤਾਂ ਹਨ—ਉਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਦਾ ਅੰਦਾਜ਼ਾ ਕੌਣ ਲਾਏ?","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line19","english":"With one utterance, the vast unfolding was brought forth.","punjabi":"ਇੱਕ ਹੁਕਮ-ਬਚਨ ਨਾਲ ਇਹ ਵਿਸ਼ਾਲ ਪਸਾਰਾ ਰਚਿਆ ਗਿਆ।","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line20","english":"From it arose streams beyond counting.","punjabi":"ਉਸ ਤੋਂ ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਦਰਿਆ ਅਤੇ ਜੀਵਨ-ਧਾਰਾਵਾਂ ਉੱਭਰੀਆਂ।","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line21","english":"What capacity have I to give a full account of Your power?","punjabi":"ਮੇਰੀ ਕੀ ਸਮਰੱਥਾ ਹੈ ਕਿ ਤੇਰੀ ਕੁਦਰਤਿ ਦੀ ਪੂਰੀ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਸਕਾਂ?","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line22","english":"I cannot offer myself in a sacrifice worthy of You even once.","punjabi":"ਮੈਂ ਤੇਰੇ ਉੱਤੇ ਇੱਕ ਵਾਰ ਵੀ ਪੂਰੀ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਸਦਕੇ ਜਾਣ ਜੋਗਾ ਨਹੀਂ।","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line23","english":"The fitting action is the one that accords with what pleases You.","punjabi":"ਉਹੀ ਕੰਮ ਭਲਾ ਹੈ ਜੋ ਤੇਰੀ ਰਜ਼ਾ ਨੂੰ ਭਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri16.line24","english":"O Formless One, You remain ever unshaken.","punjabi":"ਹੇ ਨਿਰੰਕਾਰ, ਤੂੰ ਸਦਾ ਅਟੱਲ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈਂ।","unitId":"pauri16","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri17.line01","english":"Countless are those absorbed in remembrance; countless are those living in love.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਜਪ ਵਿੱਚ ਲੱਗੇ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਪ੍ਰੇਮ ਵਿੱਚ ਜੀਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri17","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri17.line02","english":"Countless worship; countless undertake the heat of austerity.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਪੂਜਾ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਤਪ ਦੀ ਘਾਲ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri17","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri17.line03","english":"Countless recite religious books and the Vedas aloud.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਮੂੰਹੋਂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥਾਂ ਅਤੇ ਵੇਦਾਂ ਦੇ ਪਾਠ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri17","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri17.line04","english":"Countless yogic seekers keep their minds detached.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਜੋਗ ਸਾਧਕ ਆਪਣੇ ਮਨ ਨੂੰ ਉਪਰਾਮ ਰੱਖਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri17","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri17.line05","english":"Countless devotees reflect on qualities and spiritual understanding.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਭਗਤ ਗੁਣਾਂ ਅਤੇ ਆਤਮਕ ਗਿਆਨ ਦੀ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri17","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri17.line06","english":"Countless are people of virtue; countless are generous givers.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਨੇਕ ਆਚਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਦਾਤਾਂ ਦੇਣ ਵਾਲੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri17","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri17.line07","english":"Countless warriors face the steel of battle directly.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਸੂਰਮੇ ਸਾਹਮਣੇ ਹੋ ਕੇ ਸ਼ਸਤਰਾਂ ਦੀ ਮਾਰ ਸਹਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri17","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri17.line08","english":"Countless keep silence, sustaining a continuous thread of attention.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਮੌਨ ਰੱਖ ਕੇ ਲਿਵ ਦੀ ਲਗਾਤਾਰ ਤਾਰ ਜੋੜਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri17","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri17.line09","english":"What capacity have I to give a full account of Your power?","punjabi":"ਮੇਰੀ ਕੀ ਸਮਰੱਥਾ ਹੈ ਕਿ ਤੇਰੀ ਕੁਦਰਤਿ ਦੀ ਪੂਰੀ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਸਕਾਂ?","unitId":"pauri17","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri17.line10","english":"I cannot offer myself in a sacrifice worthy of You even once.","punjabi":"ਮੈਂ ਤੇਰੇ ਉੱਤੇ ਇੱਕ ਵਾਰ ਵੀ ਪੂਰੀ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਸਦਕੇ ਜਾਣ ਜੋਗਾ ਨਹੀਂ।","unitId":"pauri17","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri17.line11","english":"The fitting action is the one that accords with what pleases You.","punjabi":"ਉਹੀ ਕੰਮ ਭਲਾ ਹੈ ਜੋ ਤੇਰੀ ਰਜ਼ਾ ਨੂੰ ਭਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri17","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri17.line12","english":"O Formless One, You remain ever unshaken.","punjabi":"ਹੇ ਨਿਰੰਕਾਰ, ਤੂੰ ਸਦਾ ਅਟੱਲ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈਂ।","unitId":"pauri17","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri18.line01","english":"Countless remain foolish, sunk in profound unawareness.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਮੂਰਖਤਾ ਅਤੇ ਡੂੰਘੀ ਅਗਿਆਨਤਾ ਵਿੱਚ ਡੁੱਬੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri18","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri18.line02","english":"Countless steal and live by taking what is not rightfully theirs.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਚੋਰੀ ਕਰਦੇ ਅਤੇ ਹੋਰਨਾਂ ਦਾ ਹੱਕ ਮਾਰ ਕੇ ਜੀਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri18","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri18.line03","english":"Countless wield commands and coercion, then pass away.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਹੁਕਮ ਤੇ ਧੱਕਾ ਚਲਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਆਖ਼ਰ ਤੁਰ ਜਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri18","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri18.line04","english":"Countless cut throats and carry out killing.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਗਲ ਵੱਢਦੇ ਅਤੇ ਹੱਤਿਆ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri18","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri18.line05","english":"Countless keep committing wrongdoing throughout their lives.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਪਾਪ ਕਰਦੇ-ਕਰਦੇ ਜੀਵਨ ਬਿਤਾ ਜਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri18","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri18.line06","english":"Countless make falsehood their way and remain occupied with it.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਝੂਠ ਨੂੰ ਆਪਣਾ ਸੁਭਾਉ ਬਣਾ ਕੇ ਉਸੇ ਵਿੱਚ ਫਿਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri18","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri18.line07","english":"Countless, degraded in conduct, feed on filth—the verse's severe image for corruption.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਮਲੀਨ ਆਚਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ ਮੈਲ ਨੂੰ ਹੀ ਖੁਰਾਕ ਬਣਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ—ਇਹ ਬੁਰਾਈ ਦੀ ਤਿੱਖੀ ਤਸਵੀਰ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri18","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri18.line08","english":"Countless slander others and load the burden upon themselves.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਨਿੰਦਾ ਕਰਕੇ ਆਪਣੇ ਹੀ ਸਿਰ ਉੱਤੇ ਭਾਰ ਚੁੱਕਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri18","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri18.line09","english":"Nanak offers this reflection in humility, calling himself lowly.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ ਆਪਣੇ ਆਪ ਨੂੰ ਨੀਵਾਂ ਆਖ ਕੇ ਨਿਮਰਤਾ ਨਾਲ ਇਹ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri18","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri18.line10","english":"I cannot offer myself in a sacrifice worthy of You even once.","punjabi":"ਮੈਂ ਤੇਰੇ ਉੱਤੇ ਇੱਕ ਵਾਰ ਵੀ ਪੂਰੀ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਸਦਕੇ ਜਾਣ ਜੋਗਾ ਨਹੀਂ।","unitId":"pauri18","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri18.line11","english":"The fitting action is the one that accords with what pleases You.","punjabi":"ਉਹੀ ਕੰਮ ਭਲਾ ਹੈ ਜੋ ਤੇਰੀ ਰਜ਼ਾ ਨੂੰ ਭਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri18","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri18.line12","english":"O Formless One, You remain ever unshaken.","punjabi":"ਹੇ ਨਿਰੰਕਾਰ, ਤੂੰ ਸਦਾ ਅਟੱਲ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈਂ।","unitId":"pauri18","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri19.line01","english":"Countless are the names, and countless the places.","punjabi":"ਨਾਮ ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਥਾਂ ਵੀ ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri19","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri19.line02","english":"Worlds beyond counting lie beyond our reach, farther still.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਲੋਕ ਸਾਡੀ ਪਹੁੰਚ ਤੋਂ ਪਰੇ, ਹੋਰ ਵੀ ਪਰੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri19","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri19.line03","english":"Even saying 'countless' leaves the burden of an incomplete description.","punjabi":"ਅਸੰਖ ਕਹਿਣ ਨਾਲ ਵੀ ਅਧੂਰੇ ਵਰਣਨ ਦਾ ਭਾਰ ਰਹਿ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri19","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri19.line04","english":"Through letters we name the One; through letters we offer praise.","punjabi":"ਅੱਖਰਾਂ ਰਾਹੀਂ ਨਾਮ ਉਚਾਰਦੇ ਅਤੇ ਸਿਫ਼ਤਿ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਾਂ।","unitId":"pauri19","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri19.line05","english":"Through letters come expressions of knowledge, songs and exploration of qualities.","punjabi":"ਅੱਖਰਾਂ ਰਾਹੀਂ ਗਿਆਨ, ਗੀਤ ਅਤੇ ਗੁਣਾਂ ਦੀ ਖੋਜ ਪ੍ਰਗਟ ਹੁੰਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri19","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri19.line06","english":"Letters give form to writing, speech and language.","punjabi":"ਅੱਖਰ ਲਿਖਣ, ਬੋਲਣ ਅਤੇ ਬੋਲੀ ਨੂੰ ਰੂਪ ਦਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri19","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri19.line07","english":"Through letters, the account of one's allotted circumstances is expressed.","punjabi":"ਅੱਖਰਾਂ ਰਾਹੀਂ ਸੰਜੋਗਾਂ ਦਾ ਲੇਖ ਬਿਆਨ ਕੀਤਾ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri19","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri19.line08","english":"The One who writes that order has no such inscription imposed upon itself.","punjabi":"ਜਿਸ ਨੇ ਇਹ ਲੇਖ ਲਿਖੇ, ਉਸ ਦੇ ਸਿਰ ਉੱਤੇ ਕਿਸੇ ਹੋਰ ਦਾ ਅਜਿਹਾ ਲੇਖ ਨਹੀਂ।","unitId":"pauri19","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri19.line09","english":"As the One ordains, so beings receive their portion.","punjabi":"ਜਿਵੇਂ ਉਹ ਹੁਕਮ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ, ਤਿਵੇਂ ਜੀਵ ਆਪਣਾ ਹਿੱਸਾ ਪਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri19","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri19.line10","english":"All that has been created bears the presence of Naam.","punjabi":"ਜਿੰਨੀ ਰਚਨਾ ਹੈ, ਸਾਰੀ ਨਾਮ ਦੀ ਹਾਜ਼ਰੀ ਨਾਲ ਭਰੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri19","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri19.line11","english":"No place lies empty of that Naam.","punjabi":"ਕੋਈ ਥਾਂ ਨਾਮ ਦੀ ਹਾਜ਼ਰੀ ਤੋਂ ਖ਼ਾਲੀ ਨਹੀਂ।","unitId":"pauri19","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri19.line12","english":"What capacity have I to give a full account of Your power?","punjabi":"ਮੇਰੀ ਕੀ ਸਮਰੱਥਾ ਹੈ ਕਿ ਤੇਰੀ ਕੁਦਰਤਿ ਦੀ ਪੂਰੀ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਸਕਾਂ?","unitId":"pauri19","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri19.line13","english":"I cannot offer myself in a sacrifice worthy of You even once.","punjabi":"ਮੈਂ ਤੇਰੇ ਉੱਤੇ ਇੱਕ ਵਾਰ ਵੀ ਪੂਰੀ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਸਦਕੇ ਜਾਣ ਜੋਗਾ ਨਹੀਂ।","unitId":"pauri19","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri19.line14","english":"The fitting action is the one that accords with what pleases You.","punjabi":"ਉਹੀ ਕੰਮ ਭਲਾ ਹੈ ਜੋ ਤੇਰੀ ਰਜ਼ਾ ਨੂੰ ਭਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri19","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri19.line15","english":"O Formless One, You remain ever unshaken.","punjabi":"ਹੇ ਨਿਰੰਕਾਰ, ਤੂੰ ਸਦਾ ਅਟੱਲ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈਂ।","unitId":"pauri19","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri20.line01","english":"When hands, feet and the body become covered with dirt—","punjabi":"ਜਦੋਂ ਹੱਥ, ਪੈਰ ਅਤੇ ਸਰੀਰ ਮਿੱਟੀ ਨਾਲ ਮੈਲੇ ਹੋ ਜਾਣ—","unitId":"pauri20","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri20.line02","english":"Washing with water removes that dust.","punjabi":"ਪਾਣੀ ਨਾਲ ਧੋਣ ਉੱਤੇ ਉਹ ਮਿੱਟੀ ਉਤਰ ਜਾਂਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri20","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri20.line03","english":"When clothing is soiled with urine—","punjabi":"ਜਦੋਂ ਕੱਪੜਾ ਪਿਸ਼ਾਬ ਨਾਲ ਮੈਲਾ ਹੋ ਜਾਵੇ—","unitId":"pauri20","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri20.line04","english":"Soap is applied and the garment can be washed.","punjabi":"ਸਾਬਣ ਲਾ ਕੇ ਉਹ ਕੱਪੜਾ ਧੋ ਲਿਆ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri20","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri20.line05","english":"But when understanding is stained by association with wrongdoing—","punjabi":"ਪਰ ਜਦੋਂ ਮਤਿ ਪਾਪਾਂ ਦੇ ਸੰਗ ਨਾਲ ਮੈਲੀ ਹੋ ਜਾਵੇ—","unitId":"pauri20","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri20.line06","english":"It is cleansed by being immersed in the love of Naam.","punjabi":"ਉਹ ਨਾਮ ਦੇ ਪ੍ਰੇਮ ਵਿੱਚ ਰੰਗੀ ਜਾ ਕੇ ਧੁਲਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri20","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri20.line07","english":"Virtuous and sinful are not merely names we utter.","punjabi":"ਪੁੰਨੀ ਤੇ ਪਾਪੀ ਕੇਵਲ ਆਖਣ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਨਹੀਂ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri20","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri20.line08","english":"Our repeated actions write the account that we carry with us.","punjabi":"ਆਪਣੇ ਕੀਤੇ ਕਰਮਾਂ ਦਾ ਲੇਖਾ ਲਿਖ ਕੇ ਅਸੀਂ ਆਪਣੇ ਨਾਲ ਲੈ ਜਾਂਦੇ ਹਾਂ।","unitId":"pauri20","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri20.line09","english":"What we ourselves sow, we ourselves come to eat.","punjabi":"ਜੋ ਅਸੀਂ ਆਪ ਬੀਜਦੇ ਹਾਂ, ਉਸ ਦਾ ਫਲ ਵੀ ਆਪ ਹੀ ਖਾਂਦੇ ਹਾਂ।","unitId":"pauri20","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri20.line10","english":"Nanak: our coming and going takes place within Hukam.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ: ਸਾਡਾ ਆਉਣਾ ਅਤੇ ਜਾਣਾ ਹੁਕਮ ਦੇ ਅੰਦਰ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri20","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line01","english":"Pilgrimage, austerity, compassion and giving are named here.","punjabi":"ਇੱਥੇ ਤੀਰਥ, ਤਪ, ਦਇਆ ਅਤੇ ਦਾਨ ਦੀ ਗੱਲ ਕੀਤੀ ਜਾਂਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line02","english":"These alone bring, at most, a little standing.","punjabi":"ਇਹਨਾਂ ਨਾਲ ਹੀ ਵੱਧ ਤੋਂ ਵੱਧ ਥੋੜ੍ਹਾ ਜਿਹਾ ਮਾਣ ਮਿਲ ਸਕਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line03","english":"Listen, receive the teaching and give love a place within.","punjabi":"ਸੁਣੋ, ਸਿੱਖਿਆ ਨੂੰ ਮੰਨੋ ਅਤੇ ਮਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਪਿਆਰ ਵਸਾਓ।","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line04","english":"In this way, bathe deeply at the inward pilgrimage-place.","punjabi":"ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਅੰਦਰਲੇ ਤੀਰਥ ਉੱਤੇ ਚੰਗੀ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਇਸ਼ਨਾਨ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line05","english":"Every virtue is Yours; I claim none as my own.","punjabi":"ਸਾਰੇ ਗੁਣ ਤੇਰੇ ਹਨ; ਮੈਂ ਕਿਸੇ ਨੂੰ ਆਪਣਾ ਕਰਕੇ ਨਹੀਂ ਜਤਾਉਂਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line06","english":"Without virtues taking root, devotion does not take shape.","punjabi":"ਗੁਣ ਪੈਦਾ ਹੋਏ ਬਿਨਾ ਭਗਤੀ ਦਾ ਜੀਵਨ ਨਹੀਂ ਬਣਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line07","english":"Homage to You, the source of material existence, speech and creation.","punjabi":"ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ; ਮਾਇਆ, ਬਾਣੀ ਅਤੇ ਸਿਰਜਣਾ ਦਾ ਮੂਲ ਤੂੰ ਹੀ ਹੈਂ।","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line08","english":"You endure in beauty, with delight ever present.","punjabi":"ਤੂੰ ਸਦਾ ਕਾਇਮ ਅਤੇ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਹੈਂ; ਤੇਰੇ ਅੰਦਰ ਸਦਾ ਖਿੜਾਉ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line09","english":"What was that moment, that date and that day?","punjabi":"ਉਹ ਕਿਹੜਾ ਸਮਾਂ, ਕਿਹੜੀ ਥਿਤ ਅਤੇ ਕਿਹੜਾ ਦਿਨ ਸੀ?","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line10","english":"In which season and month did this creation appear?","punjabi":"ਉਹ ਕਿਹੜੀ ਰੁੱਤ ਅਤੇ ਕਿਹੜਾ ਮਹੀਨਾ ਸੀ ਜਦੋਂ ਇਹ ਜਗਤ ਹੋਂਦ ਵਿੱਚ ਆਇਆ?","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line11","english":"The pandits did not discover that time; no Purana records it.","punjabi":"ਪੰਡਿਤਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਉਹ ਸਮਾਂ ਨਹੀਂ ਲੱਭਾ ਕਿ ਉਸ ਦਾ ਲੇਖ ਕਿਸੇ ਪੁਰਾਣ ਵਿੱਚ ਲਿਖ ਦਿੰਦੇ।","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line12","english":"The qazis did not discover that time to record in a Quranic account.","punjabi":"ਕਾਜ਼ੀਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਵੀ ਉਹ ਵਕਤ ਨਹੀਂ ਲੱਭਾ ਕਿ ਉਸ ਦਾ ਲੇਖ ਕੁਰਾਨ ਵਾਂਗ ਲਿਖ ਦਿੰਦੇ।","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line13","english":"Neither yogis nor anyone else knows the date, season or month.","punjabi":"ਜੋਗੀ ਵੀ ਥਿਤ ਤੇ ਦਿਨ ਨਹੀਂ ਜਾਣਦੇ; ਰੁੱਤ ਤੇ ਮਹੀਨਾ ਵੀ ਕੋਈ ਨਹੀਂ ਦੱਸਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line14","english":"The One who forms the world alone knows its beginning.","punjabi":"ਜਿਹੜਾ ਕਰਤਾਰ ਜਗਤ ਰਚਦਾ ਹੈ, ਉਹ ਆਪ ਹੀ ਉਸ ਦਾ ਮੁੱਢ ਜਾਣਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line15","english":"How could I speak, praise, describe or fully understand?","punjabi":"ਮੈਂ ਕਿਵੇਂ ਆਖਾਂ, ਸਿਫ਼ਤ ਕਰਾਂ, ਵਰਣਨ ਕਰਾਂ ਜਾਂ ਪੂਰਾ ਜਾਣਾਂ?","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line16","english":"Nanak: everyone speaks, each claiming greater wisdom than the next.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ: ਸਭ ਬੋਲਦੇ ਹਨ, ਹਰ ਕੋਈ ਦੂਜੇ ਤੋਂ ਵੱਧ ਸਿਆਣਾ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line17","english":"Great is the Sovereign and the glory; all unfolds through that One.","punjabi":"ਮਾਲਕ ਵੱਡਾ ਹੈ, ਉਸ ਦੀ ਵਡਿਆਈ ਵੱਡੀ ਹੈ; ਸਭ ਉਸੇ ਦੀ ਕੀਤੀ ਕਾਰ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri21.line18","english":"Nanak: self-claimed knowledge earns no honour in that presence.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ: ਆਪਣੀ ਅਕਲ ਦਾ ਦਾਅਵਾ ਉਸ ਹਜ਼ੂਰੀ ਵਿੱਚ ਸੋਭਾ ਨਹੀਂ ਦਿੰਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri21","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri22.line01","english":"Depths beneath depths, and skies beyond skies, stretch without our measure.","punjabi":"ਪਾਤਾਲਾਂ ਹੇਠ ਹੋਰ ਪਾਤਾਲ ਅਤੇ ਆਕਾਸ਼ਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਅੱਗੇ ਹੋਰ ਆਕਾਸ਼ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri22","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri22.line02","english":"Searchers tire seeking the farthest limit; the Vedas speak of this.","punjabi":"ਅਖ਼ੀਰਲੀਆਂ ਹੱਦਾਂ ਲੱਭਦੇ ਲੋਕ ਥੱਕ ਗਏ; ਵੇਦ ਵੀ ਇਹੀ ਗੱਲ ਕਹਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri22","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri22.line03","english":"Other scriptures speak of eighteen thousand worlds, all with one source.","punjabi":"ਕਤੇਬਾਂ ਅਠਾਰਾਂ ਹਜ਼ਾਰ ਆਲਮ ਦੱਸਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ, ਜਿਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਦਾ ਮੂਲ ਇੱਕ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri22","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri22.line04","english":"An account could be written only if the whole could be counted.","punjabi":"ਪੂਰਾ ਲੇਖਾ ਤਾਂ ਹੀ ਲਿਖੀਦਾ ਜੇ ਗਿਣਤੀ ਮੁੱਕ ਸਕੇ; ਇੱਥੇ ਗਿਣਤੀ ਆਪ ਮੁੱਕ ਜਾਂਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri22","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri22.line05","english":"Nanak: we call the One great; only the One knows that fullness.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ: ਜਿਸ ਨੂੰ ਅਸੀਂ ਵੱਡਾ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਾਂ, ਉਹ ਆਪ ਆਪਣੀ ਵਡਿਆਈ ਜਾਣਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri22","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri23.line01","english":"Praising the worthy One does not give us a full measure of that greatness.","punjabi":"ਸਿਫ਼ਤ-ਜੋਗ ਦੀ ਸਿਫ਼ਤ ਕਰਕੇ ਵੀ ਉਸ ਦੀ ਪੂਰੀ ਵਡਿਆਈ ਨਹੀਂ ਜਾਣੀ ਜਾਂਦੀ।","unitId":"pauri23","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri23.line02","english":"Rivers and streams enter the sea and no longer stand apart.","punjabi":"ਨਦੀਆਂ ਤੇ ਨਾਲੇ ਸਮੁੰਦਰ ਵਿੱਚ ਮਿਲ ਕੇ ਵੱਖਰੇ ਨਹੀਂ ਪਛਾਣੇ ਜਾਂਦੇ।","unitId":"pauri23","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri23.line03","english":"Even rulers of vast seas, with mountains of wealth—","punjabi":"ਸਮੁੰਦਰਾਂ ਦੇ ਸ਼ਾਹ ਤੇ ਸੁਲਤਾਨ ਵੀ, ਪਹਾੜਾਂ ਜਿੰਨੇ ਧਨ ਨਾਲ—","unitId":"pauri23","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri23.line04","english":"Do not equal an ant in whose heart You are not forgotten.","punjabi":"ਉਸ ਕੀੜੀ ਦੇ ਬਰਾਬਰ ਨਹੀਂ ਜੇ ਉਸ ਦੇ ਮਨ ਵਿੱਚੋਂ ਤੂੰ ਨਾ ਵਿਸਰੇਂ।","unitId":"pauri23","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri24.line01","english":"There is no final limit to divine qualities or their telling.","punjabi":"ਰੱਬੀ ਗੁਣਾਂ ਦਾ ਅੰਤ ਨਹੀਂ, ਨਾ ਉਹਨਾਂ ਦੇ ਬਿਆਨ ਦਾ ਅੰਤ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri24","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri24.line02","english":"Neither creation nor giving reaches an end we can measure.","punjabi":"ਰਚਨਾ ਅਤੇ ਦਾਤਾਂ ਦੀ ਕੋਈ ਅੰਤਲੀ ਹੱਦ ਸਾਨੂੰ ਨਹੀਂ ਮਿਲਦੀ।","unitId":"pauri24","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri24.line03","english":"Seeing and hearing do not exhaust what can be known.","punjabi":"ਵੇਖਣ ਤੇ ਸੁਣਨ ਨਾਲ ਵੀ ਪੂਰਾ ਅੰਤ ਨਹੀਂ ਪਾਇਆ ਜਾਂਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri24","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri24.line04","english":"We cannot fathom the full intention within the Divine.","punjabi":"ਕਰਤਾਰ ਦੀ ਅੰਦਰਲੀ ਸਲਾਹ ਦਾ ਪੂਰਾ ਭੇਤ ਨਹੀਂ ਜਾਣਿਆ ਜਾਂਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri24","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri24.line05","english":"The extent of the created universe cannot be fully grasped.","punjabi":"ਰਚੇ ਹੋਏ ਜਗਤ ਦਾ ਪੂਰਾ ਵਿਸਥਾਰ ਨਹੀਂ ਪਕੜਿਆ ਜਾਂਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri24","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri24.line06","english":"Its nearer and farther boundaries remain beyond our reckoning.","punjabi":"ਉਸ ਦੇ ਉਰਲੇ ਅਤੇ ਪਾਰਲੇ ਬੰਨੇ ਸਾਡੀ ਮਿਣਤੀ ਤੋਂ ਪਰੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri24","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri24.line07","english":"Many struggle and cry out in search of the limit.","punjabi":"ਅਨੇਕ ਲੋਕ ਅੰਤ ਲੱਭਣ ਲਈ ਤਰਲੇ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri24","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri24.line08","english":"Yet the boundaries of that One cannot be found.","punjabi":"ਫਿਰ ਵੀ ਉਸ ਇੱਕ ਦੀਆਂ ਹੱਦਾਂ ਨਹੀਂ ਲੱਭਦੀਆਂ।","unitId":"pauri24","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri24.line09","english":"No one possesses this final measure.","punjabi":"ਇਸ ਅੰਤਲੀ ਹੱਦ ਦਾ ਕਿਸੇ ਕੋਲ ਪੂਰਾ ਗਿਆਨ ਨਹੀਂ।","unitId":"pauri24","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri24.line10","english":"The more greatness we name, the greater it appears.","punjabi":"ਜਿੰਨੀ ਵਡਿਆਈ ਆਖੀਏ, ਉੱਨੀ ਹੋਰ ਵੱਡੀ ਜਾਪਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri24","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri24.line11","english":"The Sovereign is great; the dwelling is exalted.","punjabi":"ਮਾਲਕ ਮਹਾਨ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਉਸ ਦਾ ਟਿਕਾਣਾ ਉੱਚਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri24","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri24.line12","english":"Above every height stands the glory of the Name.","punjabi":"ਹਰ ਉਚਾਈ ਤੋਂ ਉੱਤੇ ਉਸ ਨਾਮ ਦੀ ਵਡਿਆਈ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri24","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri24.line13","english":"If anyone could stand at that same height—","punjabi":"ਜੇ ਕੋਈ ਉਸ ਦੇ ਬਰਾਬਰ ਉੱਚਾ ਹੋ ਸਕੇ—","unitId":"pauri24","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri24.line14","english":"Only such a one could fully know that exalted One.","punjabi":"ਉਹੀ ਉਸ ਉੱਚੇ ਨੂੰ ਪੂਰੀ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਜਾਣ ਸਕੇ।","unitId":"pauri24","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri24.line15","english":"Only the Divine knows the full extent of its own greatness.","punjabi":"ਆਪਣੀ ਪੂਰੀ ਵਡਿਆਈ ਕਰਤਾਰ ਆਪ ਹੀ ਜਾਣਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri24","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri24.line16","english":"Nanak: the gift comes through the Giver’s gracious regard.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ: ਦਾਤ ਮਿਹਰ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ ਦੀ ਬਖ਼ਸ਼ਸ਼ ਨਾਲ ਮਿਲਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri24","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri25.line01","english":"The abundance of grace cannot be fully written down.","punjabi":"ਬਖ਼ਸ਼ਸ਼ ਦੀ ਬਹੁਲਤਾ ਪੂਰੀ ਲਿਖੀ ਨਹੀਂ ਜਾ ਸਕਦੀ।","unitId":"pauri25","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri25.line02","english":"The great Giver carries no trace of greedy expectation.","punjabi":"ਵੱਡੇ ਦਾਤਾਰ ਵਿੱਚ ਰਤਾ ਭਰ ਵੀ ਲਾਲਚ ਨਹੀਂ।","unitId":"pauri25","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri25.line03","english":"Countless powerful warriors stand asking.","punjabi":"ਅਨੇਕ ਬਲਵਾਨ ਸੂਰਮੇ ਵੀ ਮੰਗਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri25","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri25.line04","english":"So many ask that we cannot finish considering their number.","punjabi":"ਮੰਗਣ ਵਾਲੇ ਇੰਨੇ ਹਨ ਕਿ ਉਹਨਾਂ ਦੀ ਗਿਣਤੀ ਦਾ ਅੰਤ ਨਹੀਂ ਪੈਂਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri25","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri25.line05","english":"Many wear themselves out in destructive pursuits.","punjabi":"ਅਨੇਕ ਲੋਕ ਵਿਕਾਰਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ ਖਪ ਕੇ ਟੁੱਟ ਜਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri25","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri25.line06","english":"Many receive again and again, then deny the Giver.","punjabi":"ਕਈ ਮੁੜ ਮੁੜ ਲੈਂਦੇ ਹਨ, ਫਿਰ ਦਾਤਾਰ ਤੋਂ ਮੁਕਰ ਜਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri25","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri25.line07","english":"Many consume unthinkingly, without end.","punjabi":"ਅਨੇਕ ਮੂਰਖ ਬਿਨਾ ਸੋਚੇ ਖਾਈ ਹੀ ਜਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri25","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri25.line08","english":"Many endure continuing pain, hunger and blows.","punjabi":"ਕਈ ਲਗਾਤਾਰ ਦੁੱਖ, ਭੁੱਖ ਅਤੇ ਮਾਰ ਸਹਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri25","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri25.line09","english":"In this prayer, even these are addressed to You as gifts, O Giver.","punjabi":"ਇਸ ਅਰਦਾਸ ਵਿੱਚ ਇਹਨਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਵੀ ਤੇਰੀ ਦਾਤ ਕਿਹਾ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ, ਹੇ ਦਾਤਾਰ।","unitId":"pauri25","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri25.line10","english":"Release from bondage comes within divine will.","punjabi":"ਬੰਧਨਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਛੁਟਕਾਰਾ ਰਜ਼ਾ ਵਿੱਚ ਆਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri25","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri25.line11","english":"No one can establish another way apart from that will.","punjabi":"ਉਸ ਰਜ਼ਾ ਤੋਂ ਵੱਖਰਾ ਹੋਰ ਰਾਹ ਕੋਈ ਨਹੀਂ ਦੱਸ ਸਕਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri25","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri25.line12","english":"If a presumptuous person claims otherwise—","punjabi":"ਜੇ ਕੋਈ ਅਣਸਮਝ ਹੋਰ ਰਾਹ ਦਾ ਦਾਅਵਾ ਕਰਨ ਲੱਗੇ—","unitId":"pauri25","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri25.line13","english":"That person knows the blows such presumption brings.","punjabi":"ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਹੀ ਪਤਾ ਲੱਗਦਾ ਹੈ ਕਿ ਉਸ ਦਾਅਵੇ ਨਾਲ ਕਿੰਨੀਆਂ ਚੋਟਾਂ ਖਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri25","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri25.line14","english":"The One knows what is needed and gives.","punjabi":"ਉਹ ਆਪ ਲੋੜ ਜਾਣਦਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਆਪ ਹੀ ਦੇਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri25","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri25.line15","english":"There are also people who acknowledge this.","punjabi":"ਅਜਿਹੇ ਵੀ ਕਈ ਹਨ ਜੋ ਇਹ ਗੱਲ ਮੰਨਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri25","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri25.line16","english":"Whoever receives the gift of praise—","punjabi":"ਜਿਸ ਨੂੰ ਸਿਫ਼ਤ-ਸਾਲਾਹ ਦੀ ਦਾਤ ਮਿਲਦੀ ਹੈ—","unitId":"pauri25","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri25.line17","english":"Nanak calls that person richer in sovereignty than rulers.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਪਾਤਿਸ਼ਾਹਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਵੀ ਉੱਚਾ ਪਾਤਿਸ਼ਾਹ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri25","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line01","english":"Divine qualities cannot be priced, nor the trade in them.","punjabi":"ਰੱਬੀ ਗੁਣਾਂ ਦਾ ਮੁੱਲ ਨਹੀਂ ਪੈਂਦਾ, ਨਾ ਉਹਨਾਂ ਦੇ ਵਣਜ ਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line02","english":"Beyond price are those who trade in them and their stores.","punjabi":"ਉਹਨਾਂ ਗੁਣਾਂ ਦੇ ਵਪਾਰੀ ਅਤੇ ਭੰਡਾਰ ਵੀ ਮੁੱਲ ਤੋਂ ਪਰੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line03","english":"Beyond price are those who come and those who take this treasure onward.","punjabi":"ਇਸ ਧਨ ਲਈ ਆਉਣ ਵਾਲੇ ਅਤੇ ਇਸ ਨੂੰ ਲੈ ਜਾਣ ਵਾਲੇ ਵੀ ਅਮੋਲਕ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line04","english":"Beyond price are loving devotion and absorption in the One.","punjabi":"ਪਿਆਰ ਵਿੱਚ ਟਿਕਣਾ ਅਤੇ ਉਸ ਇੱਕ ਵਿੱਚ ਲੀਨ ਹੋਣਾ ਵੀ ਅਮੋਲਕ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line05","english":"Divine justice and its court cannot be priced.","punjabi":"ਰੱਬੀ ਧਰਮ ਅਤੇ ਦਰਬਾਰ ਮੁੱਲ ਤੋਂ ਪਰੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line06","english":"Neither the scales nor the standard of that judgment can be valued.","punjabi":"ਉਸ ਪਰਖ ਦੀ ਤੱਕੜ ਅਤੇ ਵੱਟੇ ਦਾ ਵੀ ਮੁੱਲ ਨਹੀਂ ਪਾਇਆ ਜਾਂਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line07","english":"Grace and its sign of acceptance are beyond price.","punjabi":"ਬਖ਼ਸ਼ਸ਼ ਅਤੇ ਉਸ ਦੀ ਪ੍ਰਵਾਨਗੀ ਦਾ ਨਿਸ਼ਾਨ ਅਮੋਲਕ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line08","english":"Mercy and divine command are beyond our valuation.","punjabi":"ਮਿਹਰ ਅਤੇ ਹੁਕਮ ਸਾਡੇ ਮੁੱਲ ਪਾਉਣ ਤੋਂ ਪਰੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line09","english":"Utterly beyond price: no description contains it.","punjabi":"ਅਮੋਲਕ ਹੀ ਅਮੋਲਕ ਹੈ; ਕੋਈ ਬਿਆਨ ਇਸ ਨੂੰ ਪੂਰਾ ਨਹੀਂ ਘੇਰਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line10","english":"Even focused speakers reach the limit of their telling.","punjabi":"ਧਿਆਨ ਜੋੜ ਕੇ ਆਖਣ ਵਾਲੇ ਵੀ ਆਖਦੇ-ਆਖਦੇ ਰਹਿ ਜਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line11","english":"Vedic recitations and Puranic accounts speak of the One.","punjabi":"ਵੇਦਾਂ ਦੇ ਪਾਠ ਅਤੇ ਪੁਰਾਣ ਉਸ ਇੱਕ ਦਾ ਵਰਣਨ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line12","english":"The learned speak and offer explanations.","punjabi":"ਪੜ੍ਹੇ ਹੋਏ ਲੋਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਅਤੇ ਵਿਆਖਿਆ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line13","english":"Brahmas and Indras speak of that greatness.","punjabi":"ਬ੍ਰਹਮੇ ਅਤੇ ਇੰਦਰ ਵੀ ਉਸ ਵਡਿਆਈ ਬਾਰੇ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line14","english":"Gopis and Govinds are among those who speak.","punjabi":"ਗੋਪੀਆਂ ਅਤੇ ਗੋਵਿੰਦ ਵੀ ਉਸ ਦਾ ਵਰਣਨ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line15","english":"Shivas and accomplished yogis speak of it.","punjabi":"ਸ਼ਿਵ ਅਤੇ ਸਿੱਧ ਵੀ ਉਸ ਬਾਰੇ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line16","english":"So do the many Buddhas brought into being.","punjabi":"ਪੈਦਾ ਹੋਏ ਅਨੇਕ ਬੁੱਧ ਵੀ ਉਸ ਦਾ ਵਰਣਨ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line17","english":"Demons and gods are both among its speakers.","punjabi":"ਦਾਨਵ ਅਤੇ ਦੇਵਤੇ ਵੀ ਉਸ ਬਾਰੇ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line18","english":"Godlike people, sages and servants also speak.","punjabi":"ਉੱਚੇ ਸੁਭਾਉ ਵਾਲੇ ਮਨੁੱਖ, ਮੁਨੀ ਅਤੇ ਸੇਵਕ ਵੀ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line19","english":"Many speak, and many more attempt to speak.","punjabi":"ਅਨੇਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਅਨੇਕ ਆਖਣ ਦਾ ਯਤਨ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line20","english":"Many finish their lives still speaking of it.","punjabi":"ਅਨੇਕ ਆਖਦੇ-ਆਖਦੇ ਜਗਤ ਤੋਂ ਤੁਰ ਜਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line21","english":"Even if as many more beings were created—","punjabi":"ਜੇ ਇੰਨੇ ਹੋਰ ਜੀਵ ਵੀ ਪੈਦਾ ਕਰ ਦਿੱਤੇ ਜਾਣ—","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line22","english":"None could complete the account.","punjabi":"ਫਿਰ ਵੀ ਕੋਈ ਪੂਰਾ ਵਰਣਨ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰ ਸਕਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line23","english":"The Divine’s greatness is as boundless as its own will.","punjabi":"ਕਰਤਾਰ ਦੀ ਵਡਿਆਈ ਉਸ ਦੀ ਆਪਣੀ ਰਜ਼ਾ ਅਨੁਸਾਰ ਬੇਹੱਦ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line24","english":"Nanak: the enduring One alone knows.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ: ਉਹ ਸਦਾ ਕਾਇਮ ਇੱਕ ਆਪ ਜਾਣਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line25","english":"If someone boasts of having the full answer—","punjabi":"ਜੇ ਕੋਈ ਪੂਰਾ ਅੰਤ ਜਾਣਨ ਦੀ ਵੱਡੀ ਗੱਲ ਕਰੇ—","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri26.line26","english":"That boast places the speaker among the most unwise.","punjabi":"ਉਹ ਦਾਅਵਾ ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਮੂਰਖਾਂ ਵਿੱਚੋਂ ਵੀ ਵੱਡਾ ਮੂਰਖ ਬਣਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri26","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line01","english":"How wondrous is the doorway and dwelling from which You care for all?","punjabi":"ਉਹ ਦਰ ਤੇ ਘਰ ਕਿਹੋ ਜਿਹਾ ਅਚਰਜ ਹੈ ਜਿੱਥੋਂ ਤੂੰ ਸਭ ਦੀ ਸੰਭਾਲ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈਂ?","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line02","english":"Countless instruments and sounds arise, with countless players.","punjabi":"ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਵਾਜੇ ਅਤੇ ਨਾਦ ਹਨ, ਅਤੇ ਅਣਗਿਣਤ ਵਜਾਉਣ ਵਾਲੇ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line03","english":"So many raags and associated melodies, so many singers.","punjabi":"ਕਿੰਨੇ ਰਾਗ ਅਤੇ ਰਾਗਣੀਆਂ ਹਨ, ਅਤੇ ਕਿੰਨੇ ਗਾਉਣ ਵਾਲੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line04","english":"Air, water and fire sing to You; Dharam Raja sings at Your door.","punjabi":"ਹਵਾ, ਪਾਣੀ ਅਤੇ ਅੱਗ ਤੈਨੂੰ ਗਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ; ਧਰਮ ਰਾਜ ਤੇਰੇ ਦਰ ਉੱਤੇ ਗਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line05","english":"The record-keepers Chit and Gupt sing, whose accounts are considered in judgment.","punjabi":"ਚਿਤ ਤੇ ਗੁਪਤ ਵੀ ਗਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ, ਜਿਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਦੇ ਲਿਖੇ ਕਰਮਾਂ ਦੇ ਲੇਖੇ ਧਰਮ ਰਾਜ ਵਿਚਾਰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line06","english":"Shiva, Brahma and the goddess sing, adorned through You.","punjabi":"ਸ਼ਿਵ, ਬ੍ਰਹਮਾ ਅਤੇ ਦੇਵੀ ਗਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ, ਜੋ ਤੇਰੇ ਸਵਾਰੇ ਹੋਏ ਸੋਭਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line07","english":"Indras on their thrones sing at Your door with other gods.","punjabi":"ਆਪਣੇ ਆਸਣਾਂ ਉੱਤੇ ਇੰਦਰ ਦੇਵਤਿਆਂ ਸਮੇਤ ਤੇਰੇ ਦਰ ਉੱਤੇ ਗਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line08","english":"Yogis in absorption sing; seekers sing in reflection.","punjabi":"ਸਮਾਧੀ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਿੱਧ ਗਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ; ਸਾਧ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਵਿੱਚ ਤੈਨੂੰ ਗਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line09","english":"The restrained, generous and contented sing, as do mighty heroes.","punjabi":"ਜਤੀ, ਦਾਨੀ ਅਤੇ ਸੰਤੋਖੀ ਗਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ; ਤਕੜੇ ਸੂਰਮੇ ਵੀ ਗਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line10","english":"Scholars and great sages sing through their age-long study of the Vedas.","punjabi":"ਪੰਡਿਤ ਅਤੇ ਮਹਾਨ ਰਿਸ਼ੀ ਯੁਗਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਵੇਦਾਂ ਦੇ ਪਾਠ ਨਾਲ ਤੈਨੂੰ ਗਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line11","english":"Captivating beauties across heaven, earth and the depths sing to You.","punjabi":"ਸੁਰਗ, ਧਰਤੀ ਅਤੇ ਪਾਤਾਲ ਦੀਆਂ ਮਨਮੋਹਣੀਆਂ ਵੀ ਤੈਨੂੰ ਗਾਉਂਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line12","english":"Your created jewels and the sixty-eight pilgrimage places sing.","punjabi":"ਤੇਰੇ ਰਚੇ ਰਤਨ ਅਤੇ ਅਠਾਹਠ ਤੀਰਥ ਵੀ ਤੈਨੂੰ ਗਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line13","english":"Great warriors sing, as do beings of all four traditional life-origins.","punjabi":"ਮਹਾਬਲੀ ਸੂਰਮੇ ਗਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਚਾਰਾਂ ਖਾਣੀਆਂ ਦੇ ਜੀਵ ਵੀ ਗਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line14","english":"Regions, worlds and universes sing, formed and sustained by You.","punjabi":"ਤੇਰੇ ਰਚੇ ਤੇ ਟਿਕਾਏ ਖੰਡ, ਮੰਡਲ ਅਤੇ ਬ੍ਰਹਿਮੰਡ ਤੈਨੂੰ ਗਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line15","english":"Your loving devotees truly sing in a way that pleases You.","punjabi":"ਤੇਰੇ ਪਿਆਰ ਵਿੱਚ ਰੰਗੇ ਭਗਤ ਉਹ ਗਾਇਨ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ ਜੋ ਤੈਨੂੰ ਭਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line16","english":"Many more sing beyond my recollection; what could Nanak fully consider?","punjabi":"ਹੋਰ ਅਨੇਕ ਗਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ ਜੋ ਮੇਰੇ ਚਿੱਤ ਵਿੱਚ ਨਹੀਂ ਆ ਸਕਦੇ; ਨਾਨਕ ਕੀ ਪੂਰਾ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰੇ?","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line17","english":"That same Sovereign endures, true in being and glory.","punjabi":"ਉਹੀ ਮਾਲਕ ਸਦਾ ਕਾਇਮ ਹੈ; ਉਸ ਦੀ ਹਸਤੀ ਅਤੇ ਵਡਿਆਈ ਸੱਚੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line18","english":"The Creator is here and will remain, neither born nor passing away.","punjabi":"ਰਚਨਾ ਰਚਣ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੁਣ ਵੀ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਰਹੇਗਾ; ਨਾ ਜੰਮਦਾ ਹੈ, ਨਾ ਮਰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line19","english":"The world is fashioned in many colours, kinds and forms.","punjabi":"ਜਗਤ ਅਨੇਕ ਰੰਗਾਂ, ਕਿਸਮਾਂ ਅਤੇ ਰੂਪਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ ਰਚਿਆ ਗਿਆ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line20","english":"The Creator cares for what is made, in accordance with divine greatness.","punjabi":"ਕਰਤਾਰ ਆਪਣੀ ਰਚਨਾ ਨੂੰ ਆਪਣੀ ਵਡਿਆਈ ਅਨੁਸਾਰ ਸੰਭਾਲਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line21","english":"What pleases the One unfolds; we cannot command the Divine.","punjabi":"ਜੋ ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਭਾਉਂਦਾ ਹੈ ਉਹੀ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ; ਅਸੀਂ ਕਰਤਾਰ ਉੱਤੇ ਹੁਕਮ ਨਹੀਂ ਚਲਾ ਸਕਦੇ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri27.line22","english":"Nanak: the Sovereign above rulers calls us to live within that will.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ: ਸ਼ਾਹਾਂ ਦੇ ਪਾਤਿਸ਼ਾਹ ਦੀ ਰਜ਼ਾ ਵਿੱਚ ਜੀਉਣਾ ਹੀ ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri27","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri28.line01","english":"Wear contentment as earrings, effort as bowl and bag, and meditation as sacred ash.","punjabi":"ਸੰਤੋਖ ਨੂੰ ਮੁੰਦਰਾਂ, ਉੱਦਮ ਨੂੰ ਖੱਪਰ ਤੇ ਝੋਲੀ, ਅਤੇ ਧਿਆਨ ਨੂੰ ਸੁਆਹ ਬਣਾਓ।","unitId":"pauri28","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri28.line02","english":"Let awareness of death be your cloak, restraint your way, and trust your staff.","punjabi":"ਮੌਤ ਦੀ ਯਾਦ ਖਿੰਥਾ, ਵਿਕਾਰਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਬਚੀ ਕਾਇਆ ਰਹਿਤ, ਅਤੇ ਭਰੋਸਾ ਡੰਡਾ ਬਣੇ।","unitId":"pauri28","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri28.line03","english":"Let everyone be your companion; mastering the mind is the meaningful victory.","punjabi":"ਸਭ ਨੂੰ ਆਪਣੀ ਜਮਾਤ ਦੇ ਸੰਗੀ ਮੰਨੋ; ਮਨ ਜਿੱਤਿਆ ਤਾਂ ਜਗਤ ਜਿੱਤਿਆ।","unitId":"pauri28","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri28.line04","english":"Bow in reverence to that One alone.","punjabi":"ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਉਸੇ ਇੱਕ ਨੂੰ ਕਰੋ।","unitId":"pauri28","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri28.line05","english":"The source of all is unstained, beginningless, undying and unchanged through ages.","punjabi":"ਸਭ ਦਾ ਮੂਲ ਇੱਕ ਨਿਰਮਲ, ਆਦਿ ਤੋਂ ਰਹਿਤ, ਅਬਿਨਾਸੀ ਅਤੇ ਯੁਗਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਅਟੱਲ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri28","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri29.line01","english":"Take understanding as food and compassion as its server; resonance lives in every heart.","punjabi":"ਗਿਆਨ ਨੂੰ ਭੋਜਨ ਅਤੇ ਦਇਆ ਨੂੰ ਵਰਤਾਉਣ ਵਾਲੀ ਬਣਾਓ; ਹਰ ਹਿਰਦੇ ਵਿੱਚ ਨਾਦ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri29","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri29.line02","english":"The One holds all as true Master; extraordinary powers are distracting tastes.","punjabi":"ਸਭ ਨੂੰ ਵੱਸ ਵਿੱਚ ਰੱਖਣ ਵਾਲਾ ਅਸਲ ਨਾਥ ਇੱਕ ਹੈ; ਰਿੱਧੀਆਂ-ਸਿੱਧੀਆਂ ਹੋਰ ਪਾਸੇ ਦੇ ਚਸਕੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri29","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri29.line03","english":"Meeting and parting carry life’s affairs; each receives a share within the reckoning.","punjabi":"ਮਿਲਾਪ ਅਤੇ ਵਿਛੋੜਾ ਜਗਤ ਦੀ ਕਾਰ ਚਲਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ; ਲੇਖੇ ਅਨੁਸਾਰ ਹਿੱਸੇ ਮਿਲਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri29","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri29.line04","english":"Bow in reverence to that One alone.","punjabi":"ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਉਸੇ ਇੱਕ ਨੂੰ ਕਰੋ।","unitId":"pauri29","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri29.line05","english":"The source of all is unstained, beginningless, undying and unchanged through ages.","punjabi":"ਸਭ ਦਾ ਮੂਲ ਇੱਕ ਨਿਰਮਲ, ਆਦਿ ਤੋਂ ਰਹਿਤ, ਅਬਿਨਾਸੀ ਅਤੇ ਯੁਗਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਅਟੱਲ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri29","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri30.line01","english":"The familiar story speaks of one mother bringing forth three recognized figures.","punjabi":"ਪ੍ਰਚਲਿਤ ਕਥਾ ਇੱਕ ਮਾਈ ਤੋਂ ਤਿੰਨ ਮੰਨੇ ਹੋਏ ਰੂਪ ਪੈਦਾ ਹੋਣ ਦੀ ਗੱਲ ਕਰਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri30","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri30.line02","english":"One creates, one provides, and one presides over judgment and ending.","punjabi":"ਇੱਕ ਰਚਦਾ, ਇੱਕ ਪਾਲਦਾ ਅਤੇ ਇੱਕ ਨਿਬੇੜੇ ਤੇ ਸੰਘਾਰ ਦੀ ਕਾਰ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri30","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri30.line03","english":"Yet the whole proceeds as the One wills and commands.","punjabi":"ਪਰ ਸਾਰੀ ਕਾਰ ਉਸ ਇੱਕ ਦੀ ਰਜ਼ਾ ਅਤੇ ਫੁਰਮਾਣ ਅਨੁਸਾਰ ਚੱਲਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri30","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri30.line04","english":"The One sees them but is unseen by them: a profound wonder.","punjabi":"ਉਹ ਇੱਕ ਉਹਨਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖਦਾ ਹੈ ਪਰ ਉਹਨਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਨਹੀਂ ਦਿੱਸਦਾ—ਇਹ ਵੱਡਾ ਅਚਰਜ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri30","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri30.line05","english":"Bow in reverence to that One alone.","punjabi":"ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਉਸੇ ਇੱਕ ਨੂੰ ਕਰੋ।","unitId":"pauri30","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri30.line06","english":"The source of all is unstained, beginningless, undying and unchanged through ages.","punjabi":"ਸਭ ਦਾ ਮੂਲ ਇੱਕ ਨਿਰਮਲ, ਆਦਿ ਤੋਂ ਰਹਿਤ, ਅਬਿਨਾਸੀ ਅਤੇ ਯੁਗਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਅਟੱਲ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri30","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri31.line01","english":"In every realm are the Creator’s seats and stores of provision.","punjabi":"ਹਰ ਲੋਕ ਵਿੱਚ ਕਰਤਾਰ ਦਾ ਟਿਕਾਣਾ ਅਤੇ ਪਾਲਣਾ ਦੇ ਭੰਡਾਰ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri31","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri31.line02","english":"All these provisions were set in place in one giving.","punjabi":"ਇਹਨਾਂ ਭੰਡਾਰਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ ਜੋ ਕੁਝ ਹੈ, ਉਹ ਇੱਕੋ ਵਾਰ ਰੱਖਿਆ ਗਿਆ।","unitId":"pauri31","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri31.line03","english":"The Creator makes and continues to care for creation.","punjabi":"ਸਿਰਜਣਹਾਰ ਰਚਦਾ ਅਤੇ ਆਪਣੀ ਰਚਨਾ ਨੂੰ ਸੰਭਾਲਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri31","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri31.line04","english":"Nanak: the enduring One’s work is steadfastly true.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ: ਸਦਾ ਕਾਇਮ ਇੱਕ ਦੀ ਕਾਰ ਵੀ ਸਾਚੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri31","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri31.line05","english":"Bow in reverence to that One alone.","punjabi":"ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਉਸੇ ਇੱਕ ਨੂੰ ਕਰੋ।","unitId":"pauri31","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri31.line06","english":"The source of all is unstained, beginningless, undying and unchanged through ages.","punjabi":"ਸਭ ਦਾ ਮੂਲ ਇੱਕ ਨਿਰਮਲ, ਆਦਿ ਤੋਂ ਰਹਿਤ, ਅਬਿਨਾਸੀ ਅਤੇ ਯੁਗਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਅਟੱਲ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri31","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri32.line01","english":"Imagine one tongue becoming a hundred thousand, then twenty times that many.","punjabi":"ਸੋਚੋ, ਇੱਕ ਜੀਭ ਤੋਂ ਲੱਖ ਜੀਭਾਂ ਹੋਣ ਅਤੇ ਫਿਰ ਉਹ ਵੀਹ ਲੱਖ ਬਣ ਜਾਣ।","unitId":"pauri32","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri32.line02","english":"Each would repeat the One Name hundreds of thousands of times.","punjabi":"ਹਰ ਜੀਭ ਜਗਤ ਦੇ ਮਾਲਕ ਦਾ ਇੱਕ ਨਾਮ ਲੱਖਾਂ ਵਾਰ ਆਖੇ।","unitId":"pauri32","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri32.line03","english":"The steps toward the Beloved are climbed by becoming at one.","punjabi":"ਪਿਆਰੇ ਮਾਲਕ ਵੱਲ ਦੀਆਂ ਪੌੜੀਆਂ ਇਕਰੂਪ ਹੋ ਕੇ ਚੜ੍ਹੀਆਂ ਜਾਂਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri32","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri32.line04","english":"Hearing of the skies, even tiny creatures wish to reach them.","punjabi":"ਆਕਾਸ਼ ਦੀਆਂ ਗੱਲਾਂ ਸੁਣ ਕੇ ਕੀੜਿਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਵੀ ਉੱਥੇ ਪਹੁੰਚਣ ਦੀ ਰੀਸ ਆਉਂਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri32","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri32.line05","english":"Nanak: union is received through grace; false self-importance remains empty.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ: ਮਿਲਾਪ ਮਿਹਰ ਨਾਲ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ; ਕੂੜੇ ਦਾ ਆਪਣਾ ਮਾਣ ਕੂੜਾ ਹੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri32","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri33.line01","english":"Neither speaking nor silence belongs to an independent power of mine.","punjabi":"ਬੋਲਣਾ ਜਾਂ ਚੁੱਪ ਰਹਿਣਾ ਮੇਰੇ ਪੂਰੇ ਸੁਤੰਤਰ ਵੱਸ ਵਿੱਚ ਨਹੀਂ।","unitId":"pauri33","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri33.line02","english":"Neither asking nor giving is wholly self-commanded.","punjabi":"ਮੰਗਣਾ ਜਾਂ ਦੇਣਾ ਵੀ ਪੂਰੀ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਆਪਣੇ ਵੱਸ ਦੀ ਗੱਲ ਨਹੀਂ।","unitId":"pauri33","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri33.line03","english":"Life and death are not at our absolute disposal.","punjabi":"ਜੀਉਣਾ ਅਤੇ ਮਰਨਾ ਸਾਡੇ ਪੂਰੇ ਆਪਣੇ ਵੱਸ ਵਿੱਚ ਨਹੀਂ।","unitId":"pauri33","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri33.line04","english":"Neither rule nor wealth, which stir the mind, is ours to command absolutely.","punjabi":"ਮਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਸ਼ੋਰ ਪਾਉਣ ਵਾਲਾ ਰਾਜ ਤੇ ਧਨ ਵੀ ਸਾਡੇ ਪੂਰੇ ਵੱਸ ਵਿੱਚ ਨਹੀਂ।","unitId":"pauri33","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri33.line05","english":"Awareness, knowledge and reflection are not self-created powers.","punjabi":"ਸੁਰਤ, ਗਿਆਨ ਅਤੇ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਵੀ ਇਕੱਲੇ ਆਪਣੇ ਬਣਾਏ ਜੋਰ ਨਾਲ ਨਹੀਂ।","unitId":"pauri33","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri33.line06","english":"Nor can self-command alone secure the way out of worldly bondage.","punjabi":"ਜਗਤ ਦੇ ਬੰਧਨਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਛੁਡਾਉਣ ਵਾਲੀ ਜੁਗਤ ਵੀ ਕੇਵਲ ਆਪਣੇ ਜੋਰ ਨਾਲ ਨਹੀਂ।","unitId":"pauri33","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri33.line07","english":"The One holding power creates and watches over all.","punjabi":"ਜਿਸ ਇੱਕ ਦੇ ਹੱਥ ਸਮਰੱਥਾ ਹੈ, ਉਹ ਰਚਦਾ ਅਤੇ ਸੰਭਾਲਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri33","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri33.line08","english":"Nanak: no one is inherently superior or inferior by their own power.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ: ਆਪਣੇ ਆਪ ਕੋਈ ਮੂਲੋਂ ਉੱਚਾ ਜਾਂ ਨੀਵਾਂ ਨਹੀਂ।","unitId":"pauri33","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri34.line01","english":"Nights, seasons, lunar dates and days form life’s rhythms.","punjabi":"ਰਾਤਾਂ, ਰੁੱਤਾਂ, ਥਿਤਾਂ ਅਤੇ ਦਿਨ ਜੀਵਨ ਦੀ ਲੈ ਬਣਾਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri34","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri34.line02","english":"Air, water, fire and the depths form its setting.","punjabi":"ਹਵਾ, ਪਾਣੀ, ਅੱਗ ਅਤੇ ਪਾਤਾਲ ਇਸ ਦਾ ਘੇਰਾ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri34","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri34.line03","english":"Within this, Earth is established as a place for living dharam.","punjabi":"ਇਹਨਾਂ ਦੇ ਵਿਚਕਾਰ ਧਰਤੀ ਧਰਮ ਕਮਾਉਣ ਦੀ ਥਾਂ ਬਣਾਈ ਗਈ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri34","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri34.line04","english":"Here live beings of many forms and ways.","punjabi":"ਇੱਥੇ ਅਨੇਕ ਰੂਪਾਂ ਅਤੇ ਜੀਵਨ-ਢੰਗਾਂ ਵਾਲੇ ਜੀਵ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri34","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri34.line05","english":"Their names are many, beyond a completed count.","punjabi":"ਉਹਨਾਂ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਅਨੇਕ ਹਨ, ਗਿਣਤੀ ਤੋਂ ਪਰੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri34","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri34.line06","english":"Each person’s deeds come into consideration.","punjabi":"ਹਰ ਇੱਕ ਦੇ ਕੀਤੇ ਕਰਮਾਂ ਦੀ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਹੁੰਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri34","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri34.line07","english":"The One is true, and the court is true.","punjabi":"ਉਹ ਇੱਕ ਸੱਚਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਉਸ ਦਾ ਦਰਬਾਰ ਵੀ ਸੱਚਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri34","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri34.line08","english":"There, the accepted and spiritually mature shine.","punjabi":"ਉੱਥੇ ਪ੍ਰਵਾਨ ਅਤੇ ਉੱਚੇ ਜੀਵਨ ਵਾਲੇ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਸੋਭਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri34","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri34.line09","english":"Grace places the sign of acceptance upon them.","punjabi":"ਮਿਹਰ ਦੀ ਬਖ਼ਸ਼ਸ਼ ਨਾਲ ਪ੍ਰਵਾਨਗੀ ਦਾ ਨਿਸ਼ਾਨ ਲੱਗਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri34","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri34.line10","english":"There, immaturity and maturity are truly discerned.","punjabi":"ਉੱਥੇ ਕੱਚੇਪਣ ਅਤੇ ਪਕਿਆਈ ਦੀ ਅਸਲ ਪਰਖ ਹੁੰਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri34","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri34.line11","english":"Nanak: arriving there reveals what this means.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ: ਉਸ ਹਜ਼ੂਰੀ ਵਿੱਚ ਪਹੁੰਚ ਕੇ ਹੀ ਪਤਾ ਲੱਗਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri34","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri35.line01","english":"Such is the responsibility within the realm of dharam.","punjabi":"ਧਰਮ ਖੰਡ ਦੀ ਕਾਰ ਤੇ ਜ਼ਿੰਮੇਵਾਰੀ ਇਹੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri35","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri35.line02","english":"Now consider what unfolds in the realm of knowledge.","punjabi":"ਹੁਣ ਗਿਆਨ ਖੰਡ ਦੀ ਕਾਰ ਨੂੰ ਸਮਝੋ।","unitId":"pauri35","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri35.line03","english":"So many winds, waters and fires; so many Krishnas and Shivas.","punjabi":"ਕਿੰਨੀਆਂ ਹਵਾਵਾਂ, ਪਾਣੀ ਅਤੇ ਅੱਗਾਂ ਹਨ; ਕਿੰਨੇ ਕ੍ਰਿਸ਼ਨ ਅਤੇ ਸ਼ਿਵ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri35","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri35.line04","english":"So many Brahmas are formed, in diverse colours, shapes and appearances.","punjabi":"ਕਿੰਨੇ ਬ੍ਰਹਮੇ ਘੜੇ ਜਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ, ਅਨੇਕ ਰੂਪਾਂ, ਰੰਗਾਂ ਅਤੇ ਵੇਸਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ।","unitId":"pauri35","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri35.line05","english":"So many fields of action, Meru mountains, Dhruvs and their teachings.","punjabi":"ਕਿੰਨੀਆਂ ਕਰਮ-ਭੂਮੀਆਂ, ਮੇਰੂ ਪਰਬਤ, ਧ੍ਰੂ ਭਗਤ ਅਤੇ ਉਹਨਾਂ ਦੇ ਉਪਦੇਸ਼ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri35","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri35.line06","english":"So many Indras, moons, suns, worlds and regions.","punjabi":"ਕਿੰਨੇ ਇੰਦਰ, ਚੰਦ, ਸੂਰਜ, ਮੰਡਲ ਅਤੇ ਦੇਸ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri35","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri35.line07","english":"So many siddhas, Buddhas, naths and appearances of goddesses.","punjabi":"ਕਿੰਨੇ ਸਿੱਧ, ਬੁੱਧ, ਨਾਥ ਅਤੇ ਦੇਵੀਆਂ ਦੇ ਵੇਸ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri35","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri35.line08","english":"So many gods, demons, sages, jewels and seas.","punjabi":"ਕਿੰਨੇ ਦੇਵਤੇ, ਦਾਨਵ, ਮੁਨੀ, ਰਤਨ ਅਤੇ ਸਮੁੰਦਰ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri35","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri35.line09","english":"So many origins of life, forms of speech, sovereigns and kings.","punjabi":"ਕਿੰਨੀਆਂ ਖਾਣੀਆਂ, ਬੋਲੀਆਂ, ਪਾਤਿਸ਼ਾਹ ਅਤੇ ਰਾਜੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri35","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri35.line10","english":"So many kinds of awareness and servants; Nanak finds no final end.","punjabi":"ਕਿੰਨੀਆਂ ਸੁਰਤਾਂ ਅਤੇ ਸੇਵਕ ਹਨ; ਨਾਨਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ, ਅੰਤ ਦਾ ਵੀ ਅੰਤ ਨਹੀਂ।","unitId":"pauri35","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri36.line01","english":"In the realm of knowledge, understanding shines with intensity.","punjabi":"ਗਿਆਨ ਖੰਡ ਵਿੱਚ ਗਿਆਨ ਪ੍ਰਬਲ ਹੋ ਕੇ ਚਮਕਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri36","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri36.line02","english":"There are resonances, wonders, delights and joy.","punjabi":"ਉੱਥੇ ਨਾਦ, ਅਚਰਜ, ਕੌਤਕ ਅਤੇ ਆਨੰਦ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri36","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri36.line03","english":"The realm of formation takes the character of beauty.","punjabi":"ਘਾੜਤ ਵਾਲੇ ਸਰਮ ਖੰਡ ਦਾ ਰੂਪ ਸੁੰਦਰਤਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri36","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri36.line04","english":"There, a remarkably beautiful shaping takes place.","punjabi":"ਉੱਥੇ ਬਹੁਤ ਸੋਹਣੀ ਅਤੇ ਅਨੋਖੀ ਘਾੜਤ ਘੜੀ ਜਾਂਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri36","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri36.line05","english":"That condition cannot be fully put into words.","punjabi":"ਉਸ ਅਵਸਥਾ ਦੀ ਗੱਲ ਪੂਰੀ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਕਹੀ ਨਹੀਂ ਜਾਂਦੀ।","unitId":"pauri36","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri36.line06","english":"Anyone attempting a complete account finds words inadequate.","punjabi":"ਜੋ ਪੂਰਾ ਬਿਆਨ ਕਰਨ ਲੱਗੇ, ਪਿੱਛੋਂ ਬੋਲਾਂ ਦੀ ਘਾਟ ਮਹਿਸੂਸ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri36","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri36.line07","english":"There, awareness, discernment and the mind’s understanding are reshaped.","punjabi":"ਉੱਥੇ ਸੁਰਤ, ਮਤ ਅਤੇ ਮਨ ਦੀ ਬੁੱਧ ਨਵੇਂ ਰੂਪ ਵਿੱਚ ਘੜੀ ਜਾਂਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri36","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri36.line08","english":"There emerges insight associated with exalted beings and accomplished seekers.","punjabi":"ਉੱਥੇ ਸੁਰਾਂ ਅਤੇ ਸਿੱਧਾਂ ਵਰਗੀ ਉੱਚੀ ਸੂਝ ਘੜੀ ਜਾਂਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri36","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line01","english":"The realm of grace is characterized by strength.","punjabi":"ਮਿਹਰ ਦੇ ਕਰਮ ਖੰਡ ਦੀ ਪਛਾਣ ਬਲ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line02","english":"There, no competing other holds the heart.","punjabi":"ਉੱਥੇ ਮਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਹੋਰ ਕਿਸੇ ਦੀ ਵੱਖਰੀ ਹਕੂਮਤ ਨਹੀਂ ਰਹਿੰਦੀ।","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line03","english":"There are great warriors, strong and courageous.","punjabi":"ਉੱਥੇ ਜੋਧੇ, ਮਹਾਬਲੀ ਅਤੇ ਸੂਰਮੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line04","english":"The Divine fills them through and through.","punjabi":"ਉਹਨਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ ਰਾਮ ਪੂਰੀ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਵੱਸਿਆ ਹੋਇਆ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line05","english":"They are thoroughly woven into divine praise.","punjabi":"ਉਹ ਮਹਿਮਾ ਵਿੱਚ ਪੂਰੀ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਪਰੋਏ ਹੋਏ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line06","english":"Their beauty cannot be fully described.","punjabi":"ਉਹਨਾਂ ਦੇ ਰੂਪ ਦੀ ਸੋਭਾ ਪੂਰੀ ਕਹੀ ਨਹੀਂ ਜਾਂਦੀ।","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line07","english":"They are neither spiritually overcome nor deceived—","punjabi":"ਉਹ ਨਾ ਆਤਮਕ ਤੌਰ ਉੱਤੇ ਮਰਦੇ ਹਨ, ਨਾ ਠੱਗੇ ਜਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ—","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line08","english":"Those whose hearts are home to the Divine.","punjabi":"ਜਿਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਦੇ ਮਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਰਾਮ ਵੱਸਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line09","english":"Devotees from many realms dwell there.","punjabi":"ਉੱਥੇ ਅਨੇਕ ਲੋਕਾਂ ਦੇ ਭਗਤ ਵੱਸਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line10","english":"They rejoice with the enduring One held within.","punjabi":"ਮਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਸੱਚੇ ਇੱਕ ਨੂੰ ਰੱਖ ਕੇ ਉਹ ਆਨੰਦ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line11","english":"In the realm of Truth dwells the Formless One.","punjabi":"ਸਚ ਖੰਡ ਵਿੱਚ ਨਿਰੰਕਾਰ ਵੱਸਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line12","english":"Creating and beholding, the One blesses with a gracious gaze.","punjabi":"ਰਚ ਕੇ ਸੰਭਾਲਦਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਮਿਹਰ ਦੀ ਨਜ਼ਰ ਨਾਲ ਨਿਹਾਲ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line13","english":"There are regions, worlds and universes.","punjabi":"ਉੱਥੇ ਖੰਡ, ਮੰਡਲ ਅਤੇ ਬ੍ਰਹਿਮੰਡ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line14","english":"Describe them as one may, no final end appears.","punjabi":"ਜਿੰਨਾ ਵੀ ਉਹਨਾਂ ਦਾ ਵਰਣਨ ਕਰੀਏ, ਅੰਤ ਨਹੀਂ ਪੈਂਦਾ।","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line15","english":"World upon world unfolds in many forms.","punjabi":"ਲੋਕਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਅੱਗੇ ਹੋਰ ਲੋਕ ਅਤੇ ਅਨੇਕ ਆਕਾਰ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line16","english":"As hukam is, so the activity unfolds.","punjabi":"ਜਿਵੇਂ ਹੁਕਮ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ, ਤਿਵੇਂ ਹੀ ਕਾਰ ਚੱਲਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line17","english":"The One beholds, considers and rejoices.","punjabi":"ਉਹ ਵੇਖਦਾ, ਵਿਚਾਰਦਾ ਅਤੇ ਪ੍ਰਸੰਨ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri37.line18","english":"Nanak: describing this is as hard as iron.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ: ਇਸ ਨੂੰ ਕਹਿਣਾ ਲੋਹੇ ਵਰਗਾ ਕਰੜਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri37","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri38.line01","english":"Make self-restraint the workshop and patience the goldsmith.","punjabi":"ਜਤ ਨੂੰ ਕਾਰਖਾਨਾ ਅਤੇ ਧੀਰਜ ਨੂੰ ਸੁਨਿਆਰਾ ਬਣਾਓ।","unitId":"pauri38","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri38.line02","english":"Let discernment be the anvil and knowledge the shaping tool.","punjabi":"ਮਤ ਅਹਰਣ ਬਣੇ ਅਤੇ ਗਿਆਨ ਘੜਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਹਥਿਆਰ।","unitId":"pauri38","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri38.line03","english":"Let reverence be the bellows, and sustained discipline the fire.","punjabi":"ਭਉ ਧੌਂਕਣੀ ਬਣੇ ਅਤੇ ਘਾਲ ਦੀ ਤਪਸ਼ ਅੱਗ।","unitId":"pauri38","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri38.line04","english":"Make love the vessel; pour the life-giving nectar into it.","punjabi":"ਪਿਆਰ ਨੂੰ ਭਾਂਡਾ ਬਣਾਓ ਅਤੇ ਉਸ ਵਿੱਚ ਅੰਮ੍ਰਿਤ ਢਾਲੋ।","unitId":"pauri38","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri38.line05","english":"The Shabad takes shape in this true mint of living.","punjabi":"ਜੀਵਨ ਦੀ ਇਸ ਸੱਚੀ ਟਕਸਾਲ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਬਦ ਦੀ ਘਾੜਤ ਘੜੀ ਜਾਂਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri38","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri38.line06","english":"Those receiving grace take up this work.","punjabi":"ਜਿਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਉੱਤੇ ਮਿਹਰ ਤੇ ਬਖ਼ਸ਼ਸ਼ ਹੈ, ਉਹ ਇਹ ਕਾਰ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"pauri38","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"pauri38.line07","english":"Nanak: the gracious One’s regard brings fulfilment.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ: ਮਿਹਰ ਵਾਲੇ ਦੀ ਨਜ਼ਰ ਨਿਹਾਲ ਕਰ ਦਿੰਦੀ ਹੈ।","unitId":"pauri38","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"closing.line01","english":"Salok — the heading of the closing verse.","punjabi":"ਸਲੋਕੁ — ਅੰਤਲੀ ਬਾਣੀ ਦਾ ਸਿਰਲੇਖ।","unitId":"closing","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"closing.line02","english":"Air is named as guru, water as father, and the great earth as mother.","punjabi":"ਪਵਣ ਨੂੰ ਗੁਰੂ, ਪਾਣੀ ਨੂੰ ਪਿਤਾ ਅਤੇ ਵੱਡੀ ਧਰਤੀ ਨੂੰ ਮਾਤਾ ਕਿਹਾ ਗਿਆ ਹੈ।","unitId":"closing","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"closing.line03","english":"Day and night are the two carers in whose care the whole world plays.","punjabi":"ਦਿਨ ਅਤੇ ਰਾਤ ਦੋ ਪਾਲਣਹਾਰ ਹਨ, ਜਿਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਦੀ ਗੋਦ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਾਰਾ ਜਗਤ ਖੇਡਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"closing","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"closing.line04","english":"Good and harmful deeds are read by Dharam in the Divine presence.","punjabi":"ਹਜ਼ੂਰੀ ਵਿੱਚ ਧਰਮ ਚੰਗੇ ਅਤੇ ਮੰਦੇ ਕੀਤੇ ਕੰਮਾਂ ਦਾ ਲੇਖਾ ਪੜ੍ਹਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"closing","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"closing.line05","english":"Through their own deeds, some are near and some remain far.","punjabi":"ਆਪਣੇ-ਆਪਣੇ ਕਰਮਾਂ ਅਨੁਸਾਰ ਕੋਈ ਨੇੜੇ ਹੁੰਦਾ ਹੈ ਤੇ ਕੋਈ ਦੂਰ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","unitId":"closing","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"closing.line06","english":"Those who dwelt on Naam departed after a life of earnest effort.","punjabi":"ਜਿਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਨੇ ਨਾਮ ਧਿਆਇਆ, ਉਹ ਮਿਹਨਤ-ਘਾਲ ਕਰਕੇ ਇੱਥੋਂ ਗਏ।","unitId":"closing","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false},{"id":"closing.line07","english":"Nanak: their faces are radiant, and many others are released along with them.","punjabi":"ਨਾਨਕ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ: ਉਹਨਾਂ ਦੇ ਮੁਖ ਉਜਲੇ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਉਹਨਾਂ ਦੇ ਸੰਗ ਹੋਰ ਵੀ ਅਨੇਕ ਮੁਕਤ ਹੁੰਦੇ ਹਨ।","unitId":"closing","status":"draft","humanReviewed":false}];
